<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Luca</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evanghelu Dupã Luca</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luca</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luc</para>
  <para style="mt1">Evanghelu Dupã Luca</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Multsã oaminji s-apucarã s-arãdãpseascã aspunearea a faptilor tsi s-adrarã namisa di noi, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />ashã cum nã li alãsarã atselji tsi li vidzurã cu ocljilji a lor di tu apãrnjitã shi s-featsir huzmichearlji a zborlui. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nji pãru bunã sh-a-njia, dupã tsi li cãftai tuti lucrili cu arãvdari di tu ahurhita a lor, s-lã-tsi scriu cu aradã multu tinjisite Theofile, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />tsi tini s-cunoshti alihea a lucrilor tsi ti au nvitsatã.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amintarea Prispus al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Tu dzãlili a Herodului, amirãlu a Iudeiljei, eara un preftu cu numa Zaharia, dit clasa al Abia. Muljearea a lui eara dupãyinitoara a Aaronlui shi s-acljima Elisabeta. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Di doilji eara ndreptsã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, imnãnda fãrã cusuri tu tuti dimãndãrili sh-legeli a Domnului. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ma nu avea cilimenji, cã Elisabeta eara stearpã sh-doilji eara tricuts di anji.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Cãndu Zaharia ma fãtsea lucrul a lui ca preftu nãintea a Dumnidzãlui dupã arada a clasãljei a lui, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />dupã adetea a huzmitipsiriljei prifteascã, lj-cãdzu sortul s-intrã tu templul a Domnului tsi s-ardã timeamã. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Multsãmea a popului stãtea nafoarã shi s-ruga tu oara a timeamãljei. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Un anghil a Domnului tsi stãtea tu nandreapta a altarlui a timeamãljei, lji si fãnirusi al Zaharia. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zaharia cãndu lu vidzu, s-cutremburã sh-lu acãtsã frica. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Anghilu lj-dzãsi: “Nu ti aspari, Zaharia, cã rugãciunea a ta s-avdzã sh-muljearea a ta Elisabeta va s-facã un ficior, sh-tini va lji-u badz numa Ioan. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Sh-elu va hibã ti tini harauã sh-arsiri, sh-multsã va s-hãrseascã di amintarea a lui. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Elu va hibã mari nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, nu va s-bea nitsi yin, nitsi biuturi vãrtoasi. Nãinti tsi s-amintã, va s-umplã cu Duhlu Sãmtu. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Sh-elu va lji toarnã multsã di hiljilji al Israel la Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a lor. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Sh-va neagã nãintea a Domnului cu duh sh-putearea al Elia, tra s-lji toarnã ininjli a pãrintsãlor la hiljilji, sh-rebiljilji la mintimeniljea a ndreptsãlor, tra s-lji etimãseascã a Domnului un popul etimu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zaharia ntribã anghilu: “Cum va u cunoscu aestã? Cã mini escu aush sh-muljearea a mea easti tricutã di anji.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Sh-anghilu lj-apãndisi: “Mini escu Gabrielu, tsi sta ningã Dumnidzãlu sh-escu pitricut tsi si zburãscu cu tini shi s-tsã dau aestã hãbari bunã. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Sh-ia tini va armãnj mut sh-nu va pots s-greshti pãnã cãndu si mplineascã aesti, cã nu ai pistipsitã la zboarili a meali, tsi va si s-mplineascã tu chirolu a lor.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Populu ma ashtipta Zaharia shi s-ciudisea cã elu ma s-amãna ahãntu multu nãuntru tu templu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Cãndu ishi, elu nu putea s-lã grea a lor, atumtsea elji achicãsirã cã elu avea vidzut un viziuni tu templu. Elu lã fãtsea seamni a lor sh-armasi mut. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Cãndu si mplinirã dzãlili a huzmitipsiriljei a lui prifteascã, elu s-nchisi cãtrã casa a lui. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Dupã atseali dzãli Elisabeta, muljearea a lui armasi greauã shi s-ascumsi tsintsi meshi, dzãcãnda: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Ashãtsi featsi Domnul cu mini, tu atseali dzãli cãndu arcã mutrita a lui durutã cãtrã mini tra s-nji mutã arushinea nãintea a oaminjlor.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amintarea Prispus al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Tu meslu a shasea tsi Elisabeta eara greauã, anghilu Gabriel s-pitricu di la Dumnidzãlu tu un cãsãbã a Galileiljei, tsi s-acljima Nazaret, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />la unã virghinã, tsi eara susita a unui bãrbat cu numa Iosif, di casa al David. Numa a virghinãljei eara Maria. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Anghilu s-dusi la ea sh-lji dzãsi: “Ghini ti aflai, tini mplinã di har, Domnul easti cu tini.” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ea s-tulburã di zboarili a lui, sh-minduia cã tsi soi di salutari eara aestã. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Sh-anghilu lj-dzãsi: “S-nu ai fricã Marii, cã ai aflatã har nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ia, tini va armãnji greauã sh-va amintsã un ficior, sh-numa va lji-u badz Isus. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Elu va hibã mari sh-va si s-acljeamã Hiljilu a Multu-Analtului. Domnul Dumnidzãlu va lji da thronlu al David, tatãl a lui. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Elu va amirãreascã pisti casa al Iacov trã totãna sh-amirãriljea a lui nu va aibã pute bitisiri.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maria ntribã anghilu: “Cum va s-fãcã aestã, cã mini ninga escu virghinã?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Anghilu lj-apãndisi: “Duhlu Sãmtu va dipunã pristi tini sh-putearea a Multu-Analtului va ti anvãleascã cu aumbra a lui. Trã atsea sãmtul tsi va s-amintã di la tini va s-acljeamã Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Elisabeta, cusurina a ta, sh-ea tu aushaticlu a ljei armasi greauã cu un ficior, sh-aestu easti meslu a shasea ti nãsã, tsi s-acljima stearpã. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Trã Dumnidzãlu tsiva nu easti niputut.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Atumtsea Maria dzãsi: “Ia, mini escu huzmicheara a Domnului, s-nji undzeascã dupã zborlu a tãu.” Sh-anghilu s-dipãrtã di la ea.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maria s-Dutsi la Elisabeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Tu dzãlili atseali Maria si sculã sh-neasi trãoarã cãtrã un loc dzinos la un cãsãbã di Iudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ea intrã tu casa al Zaharia sh-salutã Elisabeta. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Macãt Elisabeta avdzã salutarea ali Marii, cilimeanlu ansãrã tu pãntic, sh-Elisabeta s-umplu cu Duhlu Sãmtu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />sh-grãi cu boatsi analtã, dzãcãnda: “Tini eshti ghinicuvintat namisa di muljerili sh-ghinicuvintat easti frutlu a pãnticlui a tãu! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Di iu nji yini aestã doarã, tsi muma a Domnului a meu s-yinã la mini? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Cã ia, macãt agiumsi la urecljili a meali boatsea a salutariljei, cilimeanlu di harauã ansãrã tu pinticlu a meu. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Cahara di atsea tsi pistipsi, cã atsiljei va lji si mplineascã tsi easti aspusã di la Domnul!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cãnticlu ali Marii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Sh-Maria dzãsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Suflitlu a meu l-mãreashti Domnul,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />sh-duhlu a meu s-hãrseashti tu Dumnidzãlu, Ascãpãtorlu a meu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />cã elu vidzu cu arsiri aplicarea a huzmicheariljei a lui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Di tora sh-nclo tuti gheneratsili va nj-dzãcã cahara,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />cã Puterniclu nj-featsi lucri mãri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">sh-Sãmtu easti numa a lui!<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Sh-njila a lui va hibã di la bãrnu tu bãrnu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">trã atselji tsi au fricã.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Elu adrã fapti vãrtoasi cu bratslu a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">sh-dispãrtsã fudulji cu minduirili a ininjilor a lor.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Arãsturnã vãrtoshlji dit thronurili a lor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">sh-anãltsã aplicatsilji,<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />lji umplu cu bunetsi agiunjilji</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">sh-lji scoasi nafoarã cu mãnjili goali avutslji.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Elu agiutã Israelul, huzmichearlu a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">aducãnda aminti njila a lui,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />ashãtsi cum lj-avea tãxitã a pãrintsãlor a noshtri, a Abrahamului</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">sh-a urmashilor a lui di totãna.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Sh-Maria armasi cu Elisabeta vãrã trei meshi, deapoea s-turnã la casa a ljei.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amintarea al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Shi ali Elisabeti lj-vini chirolu s-amintã, sh-featsi un ficior. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Vitsinjlji sh-soia a ljei avdzãrã cã Domnul avea aspusã njilã mari cãtrã nãsã shi s-hãrsirã cu ea. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Tu dzua a opta vinirã tsi s-fãtsea avãrliga-tãljearea a ficiorlui sh-vrurã s-lji bãga numa Zaharia, ca numa a tatã-sui. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ma muma a lui dzãsi: “Nu, va s-acljeamã Ioan.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Elji lji dzãsirã: “Nu easti vãrã tu soia a ta cu aestã numã.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Atumtsea ntribarã tatãl a lui cu seamni cã tsi numã vrea s-lji bãga. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Elu cãftã un tablã shi scrie: “Numa a lui easti Ioan.” Sh-tuts s-ciudisirã. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Sh-dinãoarã gura a lui s-discljisi, sh-limba s-dizligã sh-grãi, ghinicuvãntãnda Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Tuts vitsinjlji atsia aproapi lji acãtsã frica sh-tuti aesti tsi undzirã s-arãspãndirã tu tut loclu dzinos a Iudeiljei. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Tuts atselji, tsi li avdzãrã aesti, li tsãnurã tu ininjli a lor dzãcãnda: “Tsi va si s-facã vahi aestu cilimean?” Sh-mãna a Domnului eara cu nãsu.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cãnticlu al Zaharia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zaharia, tatãl a lui, s-umplu cu Duhlu Sãmtu sh-prufitipsi:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Ghinicuvintat s-hibã Domnul, Dumnidzãlu al Israel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">cã vini sh-ari faptã arãscumpãrarea a popului a lui.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Elu anãltsã trã noi cornu a ascãpariljei,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dumnidzãlu nã pitricu Isusul s-nã ascapã cu puteari. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">tu casa al David, huzmichearlu a lui,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />ashã cum avea dzãsã cu gura a prufitsilor a lui sãmtsã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">di cu chirolu atsel vecljiul,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />tsi noi s-ascãpãm di neamitsilji a noshtri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">sh-di mãna a tutulor atsilor tsi nã aurãscu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Atumtsea aspusi njilã la pãrintsãlji a noshtri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">sh-trã adutseari aminti trã pisti-ligãturea a lui atsea sãmta,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />trã spigiurarea tsi lji featsi al Abraham, tatãl a nostru,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />tsi noi dupã ascãparea di mãnjili a neamitsilor a noshtri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">s-nã axiseascã s-lji huzmitipsim fãrã fricã,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />tu sãmtãsiri sh-ndriptati nãintea a lui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">trã tuti dzãlili a banãljei a noastrã.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Sh-tini, hilje, va ti acljenji prufitlu al Multu-Analtu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">cã tini va s-nedzi nãintea a Domnului trã etimãsiri cãljurili a lui,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />tra s-lji dai a popului a lui cunushtearea a ascãpariljei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">prit ljirtarea a amãrtiilor a lor.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Trã itia a njiluiriljei atsea ahãndoasa a Dumnidzãlui a nostru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">arãsãritul a soarilui nã yini dit tser,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />tra s-lunjineadzã atselji tsi suntu tu scutidi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">sh-tu aumbra a moartiljei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">shi s-cãlãuzeascã cicioarili a noastri tu calea a paciljei.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Cilimeanlu crishtea shi s-nvãrtushea tu duh, shi armasi tu irnjii pãnã tu dzua a aspuneariljei a lui nãintea al Israel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Amintarea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Tu atseali dzãli ishi unã dimãndari di la Cezar Augustul trã reghistrari tutã lumea Romanã. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Aestã reghistrari s-featsi di prota oarã cãndu Cuirini eara guvernator al Sirii. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Tuts njidzea ti reghistrari, cathiun tu cãsãbãlu a lui. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Atumtsea sh-Iosiful ishi dit cãsãbãlu Nazaret a Galileiljei, tsi s-njidzea tu Iudea, tu cãsãbãlu al David tsi s-acljima Betlehem, cã elu eara dit casa sh-dit soia a amirãlui David. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Elu s-dusi trã reghistrari deadun cu Maria, susita a lui tãxitã tsi eara greauã. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ashãtsi, cãndu elji eara aclo, agiumsirã dzãlili ali Marii trã amintari. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Sh-ea amintã ficiorlu a ljei prot-amintat, u-nfãshe sh-lu bãgã tu un grajdu cã tu hani nu avea loc trã elji.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Tora tu idyiul loc eara niscãntsã picurari tsi tritsea noaptea nafoarã pri cãmpuri vigljiãnda cupia a lor. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Sh-ia, un anghil a Domnului s-fãnirusi a lor sh-mãrirea a Domnului lunjinã anvãrliga di nãshi sh-elji lji acãtsã unã fricã mari. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ma anghilu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu vã-aspãrats! Cã mini va vã dau unã hãbari tsi adutsi harauã mari trã tut populu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Azã tu cãsãbãlu al David s-amintã trã voi un Ascãpãtor, cai easti Hristolu, Domnu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Sh-aestu va vã hibã semnul: voi va aflats un cilimean nfãshat sh-bãgat tu grajdu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Sh-trãoarã a anghilui lji s-adunã unã multsãmi di armata tsereascã, tsi alãvda Dumnidzãlu, dzãcãnda:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Mãrire a Domnului tu locuri di ma analti sh-pace pri loc namisa di oaminjlji cu cai elu easti hãrãcop.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Cãndu anghilji fudzirã di la elji cãtrã tser, picurarlji dzãsirã cu un-alantu: “S-nidzem pãnã tu Betlehem s-videm tsi ari undzitã sh-tsi nã ari aspusã Domnul.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />S-dusirã trãoarã sh-aflarã Maria, Iosiful sh-cilimeanlu cai eara bãgat tu un grajdu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Cãndu lu vidzurã, scurpisirã zborlu tsi lã si-eara dzãsã trã atsel cilimean. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Sh-tuts atselji tsi avdzãrã, s-ciudisirã di atseali tsi dzãsirã picurarlji. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Iarã Maria li vigljea tuti aesti zboari zigãsãnda tu inima a ljei. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Atumtsea, picurarlji s-turnarã, mãrinda sh-alãvdãnda Dumnidzãlu trã tuti tsi avea avdzãtã sh-vidzutã, ashãtsi di cum lã si-eara dzãsã a lor. <verse eid="LUK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Sh-cãndu si mplinirã optu dzãli, lu avãrliga-tãljearã ficiorlu, sh-lji bãgarã numa Isus, numã datã di anghilu nãinti tsi s-acãtsa tu pãnticã.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pãrintsãlji Adusir Isusul tu Templu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Cãndu si mplinirã dzãlili di curari dupã legea al Moisiu, lu dusirã cilimeanlu la Ierusalem s-lji-u bãga nãintea a Domnului, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />ashã cum easti scriatã tu legea a Domnului: “Cathi mascur prot-amintat va hibã sãmtsãsit a Domnului.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ex 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Elji prindea s-fãtsea curban, cum easti dzãsã tu legea a Domnului, unã pãreaclji di turturi icã doi purunghi njitsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lev 12:6-8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Tu atsel chiro eara un om tu Ierusalem cu numa Simeon. Omlu atsel eara ndreptu sh-pistimen sh-ma ashtipta ascãparea al Israel, sh-Duhlu Sãmtu eara tu nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Sh-a lui s-eara dizvãlit di la Duhlu Sãmtu cã nu va s-murea nãinti tsi s-videa Hristolu a Domnului. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Elu pimtu di la Duhlu Sãmtu, vini tu templu sh-dupã tsi pãrintsãlji lji adusirã cilimeanlu Isus s-fãtsea cu nãsu atsea tsi eara scris tu lege, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeon lu lo ãn bratsã, ghinicuvintã Dumnidzãlu sh-dzãsi:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Tora, Doamne, alasã tu pace huzmichearlu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">dupã zborlu a tãu,<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />cã ocljilji a melji au vidzut ascãparea a ta,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />tsi tini u etimãsishi tu ocljilji a tut popului:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Lunjinã trã lunjinarea a natsiunilor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">sh-trã mãrirea a popului a tãu Israel.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Iosiful sh-Maria, muma a cilimeanlui s-ciudisirã di atseali tsi s-dzãtsea trã nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Atumtsea Simeonul lji ghinicuvintã sh-lji dzãsi ali Marii, muma al Isus: “Ia, aestu easti bãgat trã cãdearea sh-alinarea a multsãlor tu Israel sh-tra s-hibã semnu trã cai va greascã contra, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />tsi si discoapirã minduirili di multi ininji. Iarã suflitlu a tãu va lu pitrundã unã spatã.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Atsia eara sh-Ana, unã prufiteasã, hiljea al Fanuel, di soia al Asher, tsi eara multu tricut di anji, sh-avea bãnat cu bãrbat-su shapti anji dupã tsi eara mãrtatã. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ea eara veduvã, sh-cu tutã cã eara optudzãtsi sh-patru di anji, nu s-dipãrta di templu, huzmitipsinda a Dumnidzãlui noapti sh-dzuã cu agiunari sh-cu rugãciuni. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Sh-ea vini tu atsea oarã, alãvdã Dumnidzãlu sh-lã spunea di aestu ficior a tutulor atsilor tsi ashtipta arãscumpãrarea a Ierusalemlui. <verse eid="LUK 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Cãndu li featsirã tuti dupã legea a Domnului, Iosifu sh-Maria s-turnarã tu Galilea tu cãsãbãlu a lor Nazaret. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Cilimeanlu crishtea shi s-nvãrtushea. Elu eara mplin di mintimenilji, sh-harul a Dumnidzãlui eara pristi nãsu.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ficiuriclu Isus tu Templu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Pãrintsãlji a lui s-dutsea cathi an tu Ierusalem la sãrbãtoarea a Pashtiljei. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Cãndu Isusul umplu doisprãdzatsi di anji, elji s-alinarã tu Ierusalem dupã adetea a sãrbãtoariljei. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Dupã tsi tricurã dzãlili a sãrbãtoariljei, cãndu elji s-turnarã, ficiorlu Isus armasi tu Ierusalem, iarã pãrintsãlji a lui nu shtia tsiva. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ma minduinda cã elu eara cu cãlãtorlji, elji featsirã unã dzuã cali, deapoea ahurhirã s-lu caftã namisa di soia sh-di cunuscutslji. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Dupã tsi nu lu aflarã, s-turnarã tu Ierusalem s-lu caftã. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Dupã trei dzãli, lu aflarã tu templu, shãdzãnda tu mesea a nvitsãtorilor, ascultãnda sh-ntribãnda elji. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Tuts atselji tsi lu asculta, s-ciudisea di mintimeniljea sh-di apãndisirili a lui. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Cãndu elji lu vidzurã, armasirã ciudisits sh-mã-sa lj-dzãsi: “Hilje, cãtse nã lu fãtsesh aestã? Ia, tatãl sh-mini, ma ti cãftam cu mirachi!” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Iarã elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãtse mi cãftats? Nu lu shtits cã prindi s-hiu la casa a Tatãlui a meu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ma elji nu lu aduchirã zborlu tsi elu lã dzãsi a lor. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Sh-ashãtsi elu dipunã deadun cu elji, vini tu Nazaret sh-lã asculta pãrintsãlji. Sh-muma a lui li tsãnea tuti tsi undzirã tu inima a ljei. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Sh-Isusul crishtea tu frunimeatsã, tu trup sh-tu har nãintea a Dumnidzãlui sh-a oaminjlor.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu Etimãseashti Calea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Tu anlu a tsinsprãdzatsea a amirãriljei al Tiberiu Cezar, cãndu Pontiu Pilat, eara guvernator al Iudei, sh-Herod, tetrarcu al Galilei, iarã fratili a lui, Filip tetrarcu al Iturea sh-a loclui a Traconitidiljei, sh-Lisania tetrarcu a Abileniljei, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />tu dzãlili a arhipreftsãlor Anna sh-Caiafa, zborlu a Dumnidzãlui vini la Ioan, hiljiu al Zaharia tu irnjii. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Atumtsea elu tricu tutã loclu anvãrliga di Iordan, predicãnda pitedzlu a mitãnjusiriljei trã ljirtarea a amãrtiilor, <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />cum easti scriatã tu cartea a prufitlui Isaia:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Boatsea atsilui tsi greashti tu irnjii:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Ndridzets calea trã Domnul,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">sh-ndriptats cãljurili a lui!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Cathi vali va s-umplã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">sh-cathi munti sh-dzeanã va s-apleacã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">locurili strãmbi va si ndripteadzã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">sh-cãljurili atseali aspri va s-ashtearnã.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Cathi om va veadã ascãparea a Dumnidzãlui.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Ioanul lã dzãtsea a multsãmiljei tsi yinea trã pãtidzari di la nãsu: “Pulji di nãpãrtitsi! Cai vã ari nvitsatã s-fudzits di nãrirea tsi ma yini? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Fãtsets fruti buni di mitãnjusiri sh-nu apãrnjits s-dzãtsets nãuntru di voi: ‘Noi avem Abrahamul ca Tat,’ cã mini ma vã dzãc cã Dumnidzãlu poati s-lji da cilimenji al Abraham sh-dit chetri. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Tora tupoara s-bãgã tu rãdãtsina a ponjilor, sh-cathi pom tsi nu da fruti buni s-talji sh-s-arucã n-foc.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Sh-multsãmea lu ntriba: “Ma noi tsi s-fãtsem?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Atsel tsi ari doauã tunitsi s-li partsã cu atsel tsi nu ari, sh-atsel tsi ari s-mãcã, ashã s-fãcã sh-elu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Vinirã niscãntsã taxidari si s-pãteadzã sh-lu ntribarã: “Nvitsãtore, tsi s-fãtsem?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu adunats ma multu dicãt vã au ursitã.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Atumtsea suldatslji lu ntribarã: “Ma noi, tsi prindi s-fãtsem?” Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu lj-loats a vãrui cu zori, nu lj-fãtsets acuzi arãdioasi a vãrui, shi s-hits hãristisits cu paga a voastrã.” <verse eid="LUK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Sh-populu eara tu ashtiptari sh-tuts minduia tu ininjli a lor cã vahi Ioanul eara Hristolu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Ioanul lã apãndisi a tutulor: “Mini ma vã pitedz cu apã, ma atsel tsi ma yini easti ma vãrtos di mini, sh-mini nu escu axiu s-lji dizleg ligãturili a sandalilor. Elu va vã pãteadzã cu Duhlu Sãmtu shi cu foc. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Elu tsãni tu mãna a lui lupata sh-va curã grãnarlu a lui sh-va adunã grãnlu tu hãmbarea a lui, ma paljia va u-ardã tu foclu tsi nu s-astindzi pute.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Sh-cu multi alti moduri pindzea populu sh-lã dimãndã a lor hãbarea atsea buna. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ma Herodul, tetrarclu, dupã tsi s-vãrghi di Ioanul trã itia cã si nsurã cu Herodiada, muljearea a fratilui, sh-trã tuti anapudiilji tsi avea faptã, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />featsi sh-aestã arãutati bãgãnda Ioanul tu hapsi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pãtidzarea sh-Ghenealoghia al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Cãndu s-pãtidzã tut populu, s-pãtidzã sh-Isusul. Cãndu ma s-ruga, tserlu s-discljisi, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Duhlu Sãmtu dipunã pri nãsu ca forma a truplui a un purumbu sh-dit tser vini un boatsi, tsi dzãtsea: “Tini eshti Hiljiu a meu vrut, tini ti am arsit!” <verse eid="LUK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Cãndu Isusul apãrnji s-preadicã eara vãrã treidzãtsi di anji, sh-alantsãlji minduea cã eara hiljiu al Iosif, hiljiu al Eli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />hiljiu al Mathat, hiljiu al Levi, hiljiu al Melhi, hiljiu al Ianu, hiljiu al Iosif,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />hiljiu al Mathati, hiljiu al Amos, hiljiu al Naum, hiljiu al Esli, hiljiu al Nagai,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />hiljiu al Maath, hiljiu al Mathati, hiljiu al Semei, hiljiu al Ioseh, hiljiu al Ioda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />hiljiu al Ioanan, hiljiu al Resa, hiljiu al Zorobabel, hiljiu al Sealtiel, hiljiu al Neri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />hiljilu al Melchi, hiljilu al Addi, hiljilu al Cosam, hiljiu al Elmadam, sh-hiljiu al Eri,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />hiljiu al Iozeu, hiljiu al Eliezer, hiljiu al Iorim, hiljiu al Matthat, hiljiu al Levi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />hiljiu al Simeon, hiljiu al Iuda, hiljiu al Iosif, hiljiu al Ionam, hiljiu al Eliakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />hiljiu al Melea, hiljiu al Mena, hiljiu al Matatha, hiljiu al Natan, hiljiu al David,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />hiljiu al Iesse, hiljiu al Obed, hiljiu al Boaz, hiljiu al Salmon, hiljiu al Nahson,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />hiljiu al Aminadab, hiljiu al Admin, hiljiu al Arni, hiljiu al Ezron, hiljiu al Perez, hiljiu al Iuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />hiljiu al Iacov, hiljiu al Isac, hiljiu al Abraham, hiljiu al Terah, hiljiu al Nahor,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />hiljiu al Seruc, hiljiu al Reu, hiljiu al Peleg, hiljiu al Eber, hiljiu al Selah,<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />hiljiu al Cainan, hiljiu al Arfaxad, hiljiu al Sem, hiljiu al Noe, hiljiu al Lameh,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />hiljiu al Metuselah, hiljiu al Enoc, hiljiu al Iared, hiljiu al Mahalel, hiljiu al Cainan,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />hiljiu al Enos, hiljiu al Seth, hiljiu al Adam, sh-hiljiu al Dumnidzãu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Cãrteashti tu Irnjii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Isusul, mplin di Duhlu Sãmtu, s-turnã dit Iordan sh-Duhlu lu dusi tu irnjii. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Aclo di patrudzãtsi di dzãli lu cãrti draclu. Tu atseali dzãli elu nu mãcã tsiva sh-cãndu tricurã atseali dzãli, elu avea foami. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Sh-draclu lj-dzãsi: “Macã eshti Hiljiu al Dumnidzãu, dzãlji a cheatrãljei aishtei si s-facã pãni.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Ma Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Easti scriatã: ‘Omlu nu va bãneadzã mash cu pãni.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Deut 8:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Deapoea draclu lu dusi tu un munti analtu sh-dinãoarã lji aspusi tuti amirãrilji a lumiljei, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />sh-lji dzãsi: “Mini ma tsã dau tutã putearea sh-mãrirea a lor, cã a njia nji suntu datã sh-mini li dau a cui voi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Macã tini va ti ncljinji la mini, tuti va s-hibã a tali.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Ma Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Easti scriat: Alavdã Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a tãu sh-mash a lui va lji huzmitipseshti.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Deut 6:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Deapoea draclu lu-dusi tu Ierusalem, lu-bãgã pri mãyeaua a templui sh-lji dzãsi: “Macã eshti Hiljiu a Dumnidzãlui, arucã-ti nghios di aoa, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />cã easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Elu va s-urseascã anghilji a lui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">anvãrliga di tini tra s-ti veaglji.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Sh-elji va ti tsãnã tu mãnjili a lor</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">tsi cicioarili a tali s-nu s-agudeascã di vãrã cheatrã.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10,11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Ps 91:11-12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Sh-Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Easti scriatã: ‘Nu cãrtea Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a tãu!’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:12">Deut 6:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Sh-cãndu draclu bitisi tutã cãrtearea, s-dipãrtã di nãsu di putsãn chiro.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Arnisit tu Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Sh-Isusul cu putearea a Duhlui s-turnã tu Galilea sh-anamea trã nãsu s-arãspãndea tu tutã loclu di-anvãrliga. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Sh-elu lã-nvitsa tu sinagodzãli a lor alãvdat di tuts. <verse eid="LUK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Deapoea Isusul vini tu Nazaret, aclo iu fu criscut. Dzua di Sãmbãtã cum eara adetea intrã tu sinagogã shi si sculã trã cãntari. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Lji deadirã cartea a prufitlui Isaia, u discljisi sh-aflã loclu iu eara scriat:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Duhlu a Domnului easti pristi mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">cã elu mi aumsi trã evanghelizari niavutslji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">trã hãbãrsiri sãlãghirea a hãpsãnitslor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">sh-turnarea a videariljei a orghilor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">sh-trã alãsari liberi atselji tsi suntu disuprits,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />sh-trã dimãndari anul actseptabil a Domnului.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Deapoea u ncljisi cartea lji u deadi a huzmichearlui shi shidzu. Ocljilji a tutulor tu sinagogã eara pristi nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Atumtsea elu apãrnji s-lã dzãcã: “Azã si mplini aestã Scriturã tu urecljili a voastri.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Tuts grea ghini sh-eara ciudisits di zboarili cu har tsi isha dit gura a lui, sh-ntriba: “Ma aestu, nu easti hiljilu al Iosif?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Sigur cã voi va s-nji lu ticnits zborlu aestu: ‘Doctore, vindicã-ti tini!’ shi: ‘Atseali tsi avdzãmu cã ai faptu tu Capernaum, fã-li sh-aoatsi tu vãtanea a ta.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ma elu dzãsi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc, cã vãrã prufit nu easti ghini-ashtiptat tu vãtanea a lui. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ma, dealihea ma vã dzãc, cã eara multi veduvi tu Israel tu chirolu al Elia, cãndu tserlu si ncljisi di trei anji shi shasi meshi shi s-featsi un foami mari di pãni tu tut loclu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Sh-la vãrã di eali nu fu pitricut Elia, mash la unã muljeari veduvã tu Sarepta a Sidonlui. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Sh-tu chirolu a prufitlui Elise avea multsã leproshi tu Israel, sh-vãrã di elji nu s-curã, mash di cãt Naaman Sirianlu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Cãndu li avdzãrã aesti zboari, tuts atselji cai eara tu sinagogã s-nãrãirã multu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Si scularã, lu aĝunirã dit cãsãbã sh-lu dusirã aproapi di mãyeaua a dzeanãljei, iu eara adratã cãsãbãlu a lor, tsi s-lu arucã di mãeauã a cheatrãljei nghios. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ma elu, tricãnda namisa di elji, s-dipãrtã.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Scoati un Duh Nicurat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Shi s-dipunã tu Capernaum, cãsãbãlu di Galilea sh-lji nvitsa oaminjlji cathi Sãmbãtã. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Sh-elji s-ciudisea di nvitsãtura a lui, cã zborlu a lui eara cu autoritati. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Tu sinagogã eara un om acãtsat di un duhlu, un demon nicurat. Elu aurlã cu boatsi analtã dzãcãnda: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ah, tsi ai cu noi, Isus Nazareane? Ai vinit s-nã dãrãnji? Mini shtiu cai eshti tini: Sãmtul al Dumnidzãu!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Ma Isusul lu vãrghi: “Tats sh-eshi di-la elu!” Sh-demonul, dupã tsi lu plãscãni nãintea a lor, ishi di-la nãsu sh-nu lji featsi vãrã arãu. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Atumtsea tuts s-ciudisirã sh-dzãsirã un cu alantu: “Tsi zbor easti aestu? Elu urseashti cu autoritati sh-puteari duhurili nicurati sh-elji easã!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Sh-anamea trã nãsu s-arãspãndea tu tuti locurili di avãrliga.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Multsã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Dupã tsi ishi di sinagogã, Isusul intrã tu casa al Simon. Soacra al Simon eara lãndzit cu heavrã mãri sh-elji s-pãrãcãlsirã al Isus trã nãsã. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Isusul s-aplicã pri nãsã, vãrghi heavra sh-atsea u-alãsã. Ea si sculã dinãoarã sh-ahurhii s-huzmitipsea atsilor. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Tu ascãpitata a soarilui, tuts atselji tsi avea lãndzitsi cu lãngoari soi di soi lji adusirã a lui sh-elu lji vindicã bãgãnda mãnjili pri cathiunu di elji. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Dit multsã isha demonjlji tsi zghilea sh-dzãtsea: “Tini eshti Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu.” Ma elu lji vãrghea sh-nu lji alãsa s-grea, cã elji lu shtia cã elu eara Hristolu. <verse eid="LUK 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Cãndu alghi dzua, elu ishi shi s-dusi tu un loc ermu. Unã multsãmi marã lu cãfta sh-cãndu lu aflarã vrurã s-lu tsãnea s-nu fudzea di la elji. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ma Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini prindi s-dimãndu hãbarea atsea buna a amirãriljei al Dumnidzãu sh-tu alti cãsãbadz, cã trã aestã escu pitricut.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Sh-elu predica prit sinagodzãli a Iudeiljei.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Acljeami Protslji Ucenitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Cãndu Isusul s-aflã ningã laclu di Ghenezaret, multsãmea ma s-pindzea anvãrliga di nãsu trã avdzãri zborlu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Elu vidzu doauã vãrtsi ligati tu mardzina a laclui, di la cai avea ishitã piscarlji sh-ma aspila plãsili. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Atumtsea s-alinã tu unã di atseali vãrtsi, tu atsea tsi eara a Simonlui, sh-lji si pãrãcãlsi s-u dipãrteadzã niheamã di meal. Deapoea shidzu tu varcã sh-nvitsa oaminjlji. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Sh-cãndu ascãpã si zburãscã, lj-dzãsi a Simonlui: “Duti iu easti ma ahãndoasã, sh-arucats plãsili a voastri trã piscuiri.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Sh-Simonul lj-apãndisi: “Masture, nã munduim tutã noaptea sh-nu acãtsãm tsiva, ma ti hãtãrea-a zborlui a tãu, va u-aruc plasa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Sh-cum featsirã ashãtsi, acãtsarã ahãntu multã peshti, cãt ma s-arupea plasa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Atumtsea featsirã semnu a sotsilor a lor tsi eara tu alantã varcã s-yinea s-lji agiuta. Sh-elji vinirã sh-li umplurã doauli vãrtsi ahãntu multu cãt ma s-fundusea. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Cãndu Simon Petrul vidzu aestã, lj-cãdzu la dzinuclji a Isusului shi lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, dipãrteadzã-ti di mini, cã escu om amãrtios!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Petrul sh-tuts atselji tsi eara cu nãsu, s-ciudisea di cãt multi peshti avea acãtsatã. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ashã undzi sh-cu Iacovul sh-cu Ioanul, hiljilji al Zebedeu, tsi eara sotslji al Simon. Atumtsea Isusul lj-dzãsi a Simonlui: “Nu ti-aspari, di tora sh-nclo tini va s-hii piscar di oaminji.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Deapoea elji, trãgãnda vãrtsili tu meal, alãsarã itsido shi s-dusirã dupã nãsu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Leprosul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Iarã Isusul eara tu un di atseli cãsãbadz, vini un om umplut cu leprã. Cãndu lu vidzu Isusul, elu cãdzu pri dintsi sh-lji si rugã dzãcãnda: “Doamne, ma s-vrei tini, pots s-mi curi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Atumtsea Isusul timsi mãna sh-lu pusputi dzãcãnda: “Ie, voi, curã-ti.” Shi trãoarã lepra lu-alãsã. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Sh-Isusul lu-dimãndã: “Nu lji spun a vãrui! Ma duti, fãnirusea-ti a-preftului sh-fã un curbani trã curarea a ta, dupã cum ari ursit Moisiul, tsi aestã s-hibã ca mãrtirii trã nãshi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Sh-anamea trã nãsu ma s-arãspãndea totãna sh-ma multu, sh-multsãnji mãri s-aduna trã avdzãri sh-trã vindicari di la nãsu lãngoarili a lor. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ma elu s-trãdzea tu locuri ernji shi s-ruga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea sh-Ljirtarea a Paralizatlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Unã dzuã, dupã tsi Isusul nvitsa, eara aclo apunats nãscãntsi Farisei sh-nvitsãtori di lege, tsi avea vinitã di tuti hoarili a Galileiljei, a Iudeiljei sh-di Ierusalem. Putearea a Domnului eara cu Isusul, tsi s-vindica lãndzitslji. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Sh-ia, niscãntsã oaminji ma adutsea pri un pat un om paralizat sh-cãfta s-lu dutsea nãuntru shi s-lu bãga nãintea al Isus. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ma, niaflãnda pri iu s-intra nãuntru trã itia a multsãmiljei, s-alinarã pri citia a casãljei shi lu dipunarã di citii cu tut patul namisa di oaminji nãintea al Isus. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Vidzãnda pistea a lor, elu lji dzãsi a paralizatlui: “Om, amãrtiili a tali tsã suntu ljirtati.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Atumtsea scriblji sh-Fariseilji apãrnjirã s-mindueascã: “Cai easti aestu tsi dzãtsi blãsteami? Cai poati s-li ljeartã amãrtiili, dicãt mash un, Dumnidzãlu?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ma Isusul, cunuscãnda minduirili a lor, lo zborlu sh-ntribã: “Tsi minduits tu ininjli a voastri? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Tsi easti ma lishor s-dzãts: ‘Amãrtiili a voastri suntu ljirtati,’ icã s-dzãts: ‘Scoalã-ti sh-imnã’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ghini-ma, mini voi si shtits cã Hiljilu a Omlui ari autoritati pri loc s-ljeartã amãrtiili.” Ashã elu lj-dzãsi a paralizatlui: “Mini ts-dzãc, scoalã-ti, ljea patlu a tãu sh-duti la casa a ta!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Sh-trãoarã atsel om si sculã nãintea a lor, lo patlu iu eara ashtirnat shi s-dusi la casa a lui, alãvdãnda Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Tuts s-ciudisirã sh-alãvda Dumnidzãlu, shi mplini di fricã, dzãtsea: “Azã vidzum lucri thãvmãsiti.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Acljeami Levi sh-Mãcã cu Amãrtioshlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Dupã aesti lucri, Isusul ishi sh-vidzu un taxidar, tsi s-acljima Levi, cai shãdea tu loclu a taxilor, sh-lji dzãsi: “Urmeadzã-mi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Levi li alãsã tuti, si sculã sh-lu urmã. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Deapoea Levi lj-adrã la casa a lui un uspetsi mari sh-unã multsãmi mari di taxidari sh-altsã shidea la measã deadun cu elji. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ma Fariseilji sh-scriblji pushpura contra a ucenitsilor al Isus dzãcãnda: “Cãtse mãcats sh-bets deadun cu taxidarlji sh-amãrtioshlji?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Sh-Isusul lã apãndisi: “Nu suntu sãnãtoshlji atselji tsi au ananghi di doctor, ma nipututsilji. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Mini nu vinj s-acljem ndreptsãlji, ma amãrtioshlji trã mitãnjiusiri.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul lu Ntribarã trã Pãreasinjli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Atumtsea elji lji dzãsirã: “Cãtse ucenitsilji al Ioan sh-atselji a Fariseilor agiunedzu totãna shi s-roagã, iarã a tãlji mãcã sh-bea?” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Elu lã apãndisi a lor: “Putets s-li fãtsets numtarlji s-tsãnã pãreasinji, pãnã cãndu dzinirli easti cu nãshi? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ma va yinã dzãlili cãndu va lu ljea dzinirli sh-atumtsea, tu atseali dzãli, elji va agiuneadzã.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Apoea lã aspusi unã parabolã: “Vãrã nu bagã un peatic di un stranjiu nou la un stranjiu vecljiu, altã soi peaticlu di stranjilu atsel nou va arupã stranjilu atsel vecljiu, sh-peaticlu atsel noulu nu s-uidiseashti la stranjilu atsel vecljiu. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Sh-vãrã nu bagã yin nou tu folji veclji, altã soi yinlu atsel nou arupi foljilji, yinlu s-vearsi sh-foljilji cher. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Trã atsea yinlu atsel nou s-bagã tu folji noi. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Vãrã tsi ari biutã yin vecljiu, nu va yin nou, cã elu dzãtsi: ‘Vecljul easti ma bun.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Easti Domnul a Sãmbãtãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Unã dzuã, dupã Sãmbãta Isusul ma tritsea prit agrili cu grãnu, sh-ucenitsilji a lui arupea schicuri, li fãrca cu mãnjili sh-li mãca. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Niscãntsã di Fariseilji lji ntribarã: “Cãtse fãtsets atsea tsi nu easti volje si s-fãcã Sãmbãta?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Ma Isusul lã apãndãsi a lor: “Nu avets cãntatã tsi featsi Davidul sh-atselji tsi eara deadun cu nãsu cãndu agiuna? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Cum intrã tu casa a Dumnidzãlui, elu lo pãnjili a bãgarãljei nãinti, mãcã elu sh-lã deadi ti mãcari sh-atsilor tsi eara deadun cu nãsu. Atseli pãnji nu eara volje ti vãrã s-li mãca, dicãt mash preftsãlji.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Apoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Hiljilu a Omlui easti Domnu a Sãmbãtãljei.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Una altã Sãmbãtã Isusul intrã tu sinagogã sh-ma nvitsa. Aclo eara un om tsi avea mãna atsea ndreapta uscatã. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Scriblji sh-Fariseilji ma lu vigljea, macã elu va lu vindica Sãmbãta, tsi deapoea s-lu vãrghea. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ma elu li cunushtea minduirili a lor shi lji dzãsi a omlui cu mãna uscatã: “Scoalã-ti shi shedz aoa tu mesi.” Sh-elu si sculã pri cicioari shi stãtu aclo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini ma vã ntreb: Easti volje tu dzua di Sãmbãtã, s-fatsi ghini icã s-fatsi arãu, s-ascachi un om icã s-lu cheri?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Sh-cum lj-mutri tuts di anvãrliga, lj-dzãsi a omlui: “Tindi mãna a ta!” Elu u teasi mãna sh-mãna a lui s-featsi sãnãtoasã. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Elji s-nevrisirã sh-ahurhirã si zbura un cu-alantu cã tsi putea s-lji fãtsea a Isusului.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alidzearea a Doisprãdzatsi Apostulji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Tu atseali dzãli Isusul s-dusi tu munti ti rugari, sh-tricu noaptea cu rugãciuni cãtrã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Sh-cãndu alghi dzua, acljimã ningã nãsu ucenitsilji a lui sh-aleapsi di nãshi doisprãdzatsi sh-lji numi apostulji. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Aeshti eara: Simonul tsi lj-bãgã numa Petru, sh-Andrea, fratili a lui, Iacovul sh-Ioanul, Filipul sh-Bartolomeu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateu sh-Toma, Iacovul, hiljilu al Alfeu, sh-Simonul, tsi s-acljima Zelotlu, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Iuda, hiljilu al Iacov, sh-Iuda Iscariotlu, tsi s-featsi prudot.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ghinicuvintãrili sh-Spigiurãrili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Apoea, dipunã deadun cu nãshi, dãnãsi pri unã padi, cu multsãmea a ucenitsilor a lui sh-cu unã multsãmi mari di oaminji di tutã Iudea, di Ierusalem sh-di pri ningã amarea a Tirlui sh-a Sidonlui, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />tsi avea vinitã s-lu asculta shi s-vindica di niputerili a lor. Sh-atselji tsi s-munduea di duhurili nicurati s-vindica. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Tutã multsãmea cãfta s-lu pusputea, cã di la nãsu ishea unã fuchii tsi lji vindica tuts.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Isusul, sculã ocljilji cãtrã ucenitsilji a lui sh-dzãsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Ghinicuvintats s-hits voi, oarfãnji, cã a voastrã easti amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Ghinicuvintats s-hits voi, tsi tora avets foami, cã va s-vã fãnãtits.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Ghinicuvintats s-hits voi, tsi tora plãndzets, cã va s-arãdets.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Ghinicuvintats s-hits voi, cãndu oaminjlji va vã aurascã, va vã scoatã afoarã sh-va vã ngiurã, va u aspunã numa a voastrã ti arãu, trã itia a Hiljilui a Omlui.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Hãrsits-vã tu atsea dzuã sh-giucats di harauã, cã ia, arãsplãtirea a voastrã easti mari tu tseruri. Ashãtsi pãrintsãlji a lor fãtsea cu prufitsilji.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ma cavai di voi, avutsi, cã tora u avets loatã diznjirdarea a voastrã.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Cavai di voi, tsi tora hits fãnãtits, cã va avets foami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Cavai di voi, tsi tora arãdets, cã va vã jilits sh-va plãndzets.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Cavai di voi, cãndu tuts oaminjlji va greascã ghini trã voi, cã ashã featsirã sh-pãrintsãlji a lor cu prufitsilji arãdioshi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vrearea ti Neamitsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ma mini ma vã dzãc a voauã tsi mi ascultats: S-li vrets neamitsilji a voshtri, s-fãtsets ghini atsilor tsi vã aurãscu. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Ghinicuvintats atselji tsi vã blastimã sh-rugats-vã trã atselji tsi vã facã arãu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Macã vãrã ti agudeashti tu unã fatsã, toarnã-lji sh-alanta. Sh-atsilui tsi ts-ljea mantolu, alas-lu s-tsã-ljea sh-tunica. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Dã-lji a cuitsido tsi caftã di la tini. Macã vãrã ljea tsiva di la tini, nu caftã s-ts-u toarnã. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Ma, ashã cum vrets s-vã facã a voauã oaminjlji, ashã fãtsets sh-voi cu nãshi. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ma, ma s-lji vrets atselji tsi vã vor, tsi meritã va s-avets di aestã? Cã sh-amãrtioshlji lji vor atselji tsi lji vor. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Sh-macã lã fãtsets ghini atsilor tsi vã facã ghini, tsi meritã va avets di aestã? Idyiul lucru facã sh-amãrtioshlji. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Sh-macã lã dats mprumut atsilor tsi nãdãits s-vã li toarnã, tsi meritã va avets di aestã? Sh-amãrtioshlji da mprumut a amãrtioshilor, tsi s-ljea nãpoi cãtã deadirã. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ma voi vrets-lji neamitsilji a voshtri, fãtsets ghini a lor sh-dats mprumut sh-nu ashtiptats s-vã si toarnã. Atumtsea plãtirea a voastrã va hibã mari, sh-voi va hits hiljilji a Multu Analtului, cã elu easti ghini-voitor cu aharishtslji sh-anapudzlji. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />S-hits njilãoshi, ashã cum Tatãl a vostru easti njilãos.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvitsãtura pri Giudicata Altsilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Nu giudicats sh-nu va hits giudicats. Nu condamnats sh-nu va hits condamnats. Ljirtats sh-va hits ljirtats. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Dats sh-va vã si da. Unã mizurã bunã, ndisatã, scuturatã, mplinitã va s-vearsã tu poalã. Cu atsea mizurã tsi va misurats va vã s-misurã sh-a voauã.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Deapoea elu lã dzãsi unã parabolã: “Un orbu poati s-lji aspun cala a unui altu orbu? Nu va cadã doilji tu groapã? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Uceniclu nu lji-lu treatsi a nvitsãtorlui a lui, ma cathi ucenic ghini-nvitsatã va hibã ca nvitsãtorlu a lui. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Cãtse tini vedz paljilu tu ocljilu a fratilui a tãu sh-nu mutreshti grenda tu ocljilu a tãu? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Icã, cum pots s-lji dzãtsi a fratilui a tãu: ‘Frate, alasã-mi s-tsã scot paljilu tsi ai tu ocljiu a tãu,’ cãndu tini nu mutreshti grenda tu ocljilu a tãu? Ipucrite, scoat prota grenda dit ocljilu a tãu sh-atumtsea va pots s-mutreshti ma ghini si scots paljilu dit ocljiu a fratilui a tãu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Un Pom cu Fruti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Nu ari pom bun s-facã fruti arali, nitsi pom arãu s-facã fruti buni. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Cathi pom s-cunoashti di frutlu a lui, cã nu s-adunã hitsi di pri schinji sh-nu s-adunã auã di pri rudz. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Omlu atsel bunlu u scoati ghineatsa dit ayishtearea atsea buna a inimãljei a lui, sh-omlu atsel arãu scoati arali dit ayishtearea arauã a inimãljei a lui. Cã gura a omlui zburashti di mplinirea a inimãljei.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Casa pri Cheatrã sh-Casa pri Arinã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Cãtse nj-grits: ‘Doamne, Doamne’, sh-nu fãtsets atsea tsi vã dzãc? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Cathi om tsi yini la mini sh-avdã zboarili a meali sh-li fatsi, mini va vã spun a cui lj-undzeashti. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Elu lj-undzeashti a unui om tsi, cãndu adrã casa a lui, sãpã multu hãndauã sh-timeljilu l-bãgã pri cheatrã. Vini un nicari, traplu s-plãscãni pri casã, ma ea nu s-cutrimburã, cã casa eara adrat ghini. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ma atsel tsi li avdzã sh-nu li featsi, lj-undzeashti a unui om tsi u adrã casa a lui pri loc sh-fãrã timeljiu. Cãndu traplu s-plascãni la casã, ea cãdzu trãoarã sh-aspãrdzearea a ljei eara mari.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Pistea a Tsenturionlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Dupã tsi bitisi trã dzãtseari tuti aesti zboari trã populu cai lu asculta, Isusul intrã tu Capernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Aclo un tsenturion avea un huzmichear tsi lu axiusea multu, eara niputut sh-greu trã moarti. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Tsenturionlu, cãndu avdzã trã Isusul, lj-pitricu niscãntsã di aushlji a Iudeilor si lj-ruga s-yinea s-vindica huzmichearlu a lui. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Cum agiumsirã la Isusul, elji lji si rugarã multu dzãcãnda: “Elu easti axiu tsi tini s-lji fats aestã ghineatsã, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />cã elu lu va populu a nostru sh-elu u adrã sinagoga ti noi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Atumtsea Isusul s-dusi cu nãshi. Cãndu nu eara multu diparti di casã, tsenturionlu pitricu niscãntsã oaspits s-lji dzãtsea: “Doamne, nu ti cãrtea cã mini nu escu axiu tsi tini s-intsrã tu citia a mea. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Tr-atsea nu mi lugursii ti axiu s-yin la tini. Ma tini dzã mash un zbor sh-huzmichearlu a meu va s-vindicã. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Cã sh-mini escu un om sum cumanda altui sh-am sum mini suldats. Cãndu lj-dzãc a unui: ‘Duti,’ elu s-dutsi, sh-cãndu lj-dzãc a altui: ‘Haidi,’ elu yini. Cãndu lj-dzãc a huzmichearlui a meu: ‘Fã aestã,’ elu u-fatsi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Cãndu Isusul li avdzã aesti zboari, s-thãvmãtisi cu nãsu, s-turnã cãtrã multsãmea tsi lu urma sh-dzãsi: “Mini ma vã dzãc cã nitsi tu Israel nu am aflatã ahãntã mari pisti.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Sh-cãndu pitricutslji s-turnarã la casã, aflarã vindicatã huzmichearlu tsi eara niputut.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nyie Hiljilu a Veduvãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Dupã niheamã Isusul s-dusi tu un cãsãbã tsi s-acljima Nain. Deadun cu nãsu njidzea ucenitsilji a lui sh-unã multsãmi mari. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Cãndu s-apruche di poarta a cãsãbãlui, vidzu cã ma dutsea ti ngrupari un mortu, singurlu hiljiu a mumãljei a lui, tsi eara veduvã. Unã multsãmi mari di cãsãbã eara cu nãsã. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Macãt u vidzu, Domnu avu njilã trã nãsã sh-lji dzãsi: “Nu plãndzi!” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Deapoea s-apruche, bãgã mãna pri sinduchi sh-atselji tsi u purta dãnãsirã. Atumtsea elu dzãsi: “Tinire, mini tsã dzãc, scoalã-ti!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Sh-mortul si sculã sh-ahurhi si zburãscã. Sh-Isusul lji-lu deadi a mãsiljei. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Atumtsea tuts s-ciudisirã sh-alãvda Dumnidzãlu dzãcãnda: “Namisa di noi easti fãnirusit un prufit mari,” shi: “Dumnidzãlu vidzu populu a lui.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Shi hãbarea aestã s-arãspãndi tu tutã Iudea sh-anvãrliga di tut loclu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul sh-Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Ucenitsilji al Ioan lji spusirã a lui trã tuti aesti. Ioanul acljimã ningã nãsu doi di ucenitsilji a lui, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />sh-lji pitricu la Domnul s-lji dzãtsea: “Eshti tini atsel tsi prindi s-yinã, ama prindi s-ashtiptãm vãrã altu?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Aeshti bãrbats s-dusirã la elu sh-lji dzãsirã: “Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu nã pitricu la tini s-ti ntribãm: ‘Eshti tini atsel tsi prindi s-yinã, ama prindi s-ashtiptãm vãrã altu?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Tu atsea oarã Isusul avea vindicatã multsã oaminji di lãngoari, di munduirili sh-di duhurili nicurati sh-la multsã orghi lã deadi videarea. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Atumtsea Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Imnats sh-dzãtsets al Ioan tsi avets vidzutã sh-tsi avetsã avdzãtã: Orghilji amintarã nãpoi videarea, shcljiochlji imnã, leproshilji ma s-curã, surdzãlji ma avdã, mortsãlji ma s-nyeadzã sh-evanghelu s-dimãndã la niavutslji. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ghinicuvintat s-hibã atsel tsi nu s-ncheadicã di itia a mea!” <verse eid="LUK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Cãndu pitricutslji al Ioan fudzirã, elu apãrnji s-dzãcã a multsãnjilor trã Ioanul: “Tsi vrets s-videts tu irnjii? Un cãlami tsi u-mina vimtul? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Tsi vrets s-videts tsi ishit? Un om nviscut cu stranjii moali? Ia, atselji tsi poartã stranji scunchi, bãneadzã tu aveari sh-tu cãsi amirãreshti. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Tsi vrets s-videts tsi ishit? Un prufit? Ie, mini ma vã dzãc, ninga ma multu di un prufit. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ioanul easti atsel trã cai easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Ia mini ma pitrec nãintea a fatsãljei a ta mãndatorlu a meu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">tsi va s-ndreagã calea nãintea a ta.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Cã mini ma vã dzãc tsi di amintatslji di la muljeri nu easti nitsiun ma mari dicãt Ioan. Ma njiclu tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui easti ma mari dicãt nãsu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Tut populu tsi lu avdzã sh-taxidarlji lj-deadirã ndriptati a Dumnidzãlui cã s-pãtidzarã cu pitedzlu a Ioanului. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Fariseilji sh-nvitsãtorlji a legiljei lu arnisirã planlu a Dumnidzãlui trã nãshi cã nu s-pãtidzarã di la Ioan. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Atumtsea Isusul dzãsi: “Cu tsi s-lji undzescu, oaminjlji a aishtei gheneratsi? Sh-a cui lj-undzescu? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Lji undzescu a cilimenjilor tsi sta pri pãdzi sh-aurlã a sotsilor dzãcãnda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Noi avem bãtutã flueara ti voi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">sh-voi nu avets giucat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Noi avem vãitat di voi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">sh-voi nu avets plãmsit.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Vini Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu, tsi nu mãca pãni sh-nitsi nu bea yin sh-voi dzãtsets: ‘Elu ari un demon.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Vini Hiljilu a Omlui tsi mãca sh-bea, sh-voi dzãtsets: ‘Ia, mãcãtorlu sh-biutorlu, oaspilu a taxidarilor shi a amãrtioshilor.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ma a mintimeniljei al Dumnidzã lji da ndriptati tuts hiljilji a ljei.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muljearea Amãrtioasã Aumsi Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Un di Fariseilji acljimã Isusul s-mãca deadun cu nãsu. Elu intrã tu casa a Fariseului shi s-apunã la measã. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Sh-ia, unã muljeari di atsel cãsãbã, tsi eara unã amãrtioasã, cãndu lo di hãbari cã Isusul eara la measa a un Fariseu, adusi unã vasã di alabastru mplin cu untulem cu bunã njurizmã. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ea stãtea dinãpoi la cicioarili a lui sh-plãngãnda, apãrnji s-lji li spila cu lãcri cicioarili, s-lji li ashteargã cu perili a caplui a ljei, s-lji li bãsha cicioarili shi s-lji li aundzea cu untulem cu bunã njurizmã. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Cãndu lu vidzu aestã Fariseulu tsi lu avea acljimat, dzãsi cu mintea a lui: “Aestu ma s-eara prufit, va shtia tsi soi di om easti muljearea tsi bãgã mãna, cã ea easti amãrtioasã.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Simone, voi s-tsã dzãc tsiva.” Sh-elu lj-apãndisi: “Nvitsãtore, grea.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Sh-Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Un om avea doi mprumutatsi. Un lji avea mprumut tsintsisuti di denari sh-alantu tsindzãtsi. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Cãndu elji nu avea s-plãtea, elu lã ljirtã a doilor mprumutlu. Dupã tini, cai di elji va l-va ma multu?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simonul lj-apãndisi: “Minduescu, elu a cui s-ljirtã ma multu.” Sh-Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Giudicash ndreptu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Apoea s-turnã cãtrã muljearea shi lj-dzãsi a Simonlui: “U vedz muljearea aestã? Mini intrai tu casa a ta sh-tini nu nj-dãdeshi apã di aspilari cicioarili, ma ea nji-li aspilã cicioarili cu lãcrinji a ljei sh-nji-li ashtearsi cu perli a caplui. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Tini nu nj-dãdeshi nitsi unã bãshari, ma ea di cãndu intrai, nu pãpsi di bãshari cicioarili a meali. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Tini nu nj-aumsesh caplu cu untulem di masin, iarã ea nji-li aumsi cicioarili cu untulem cu njurizmã bunã. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Trã atsea mini ma tsã dzãc cã amãrtiili a ljei atseali multi suntu ljirtati, cum u aspusi mari vrearea a ljei. Ma a cui lji-si ljeartã putsãn, ari putsãn vreari.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Apoea lj-dzãsi a ljei: “Amãrtiili a tali tsã suntu ljirtati.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Atumtsea atselji tsi eara la measã deadun cu Isusul apãrnjirã s-dzãtsea cu mintea a lor: “Cai easti aestu cai ljeartã sh-amãrtiili?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Iarã Isusul lj-dzãsi a muljeariljei: “Pistea a ta ti ascãpã. Duti tu pace!”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Siminãtorlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Dupã aestã Isusul imna prit cãsãbadzi sh-prit hoari, predicãnda sh-dimãndãnda hãbarea atsea buna a amirãriljei a Dumnidzãlui. Cu nãsu eara di doisprãdzatslji, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />sh-niscãnti muljeri, tsi li avea vindicatã di duhurili nicurati sh-di lãngoarili: Maria, acljimatã Magdalena, di la cai avea ishit shapti demonji, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Ioana, muljearea al Huza, icunomlu a Herodului, Suzana sh-multi alti tsi agiuta atselji cu averili a lor. <verse eid="LUK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Cum s-adunã unã multsãmi mari tsi lji vinirã di tuti cãsãbadzli, Isusul lã dzãsi cu parabolã: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Un siminãtor ishi si seaminã simintsa a lui. Siminãnda, unã parti cãdzu mardzina a caliljei, s-ncãlcã sh-puljilji a tserlui u mãcarã. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Unã altã parti cãdzu prit chetsri sh-macãt fitrusi, s-uscã cã nu avea vlagã. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Unã altã parti cãdzu prit schinji. Schinjilji criscurã deadun cu simintsa sh-lji acãtsarã rãsuflarea. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Iarã unã parti cãdzu tu loc bun. Fitrusi sh-deadi carpo un sutã di ori ma multu.” Cum li dzãsi aesti zboari, adãvgã: “Cai ari ureclji trã avdzãri, s-avdã!” <verse eid="LUK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji a lui lu ntribarã cã tsi va s-dzãcã aestã parabolã. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi: “A voauã vã-si easti datã s-cunushtets mistiryili a amirãriljei a Dumnidzãlui, ma alantsãlor aspusã cu parabolã, tsi ‘elji mutrinda s-nu veadã, sh-avdzãnda s-nu aducheascã.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Aestã easti achicãsirea a parabolãljei: Simintsa easti zborlu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Atselji ningã cali suntu atselji tsi lu avdã zborlu, ma, apoia yini draclu sh-lã-u ljea zborlu dit inima a lor, tsi elji s-nu pistipseascã shi s-nu s-ascapã. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Atselji dit loc chitros suntu atselji tsi, cãndu avdu, lu ashteaptã zborlu cu harauã. Ma atselji nu au arãdãtsinã, pistipsescu di putsãn chiro, ma tu oara a provãljei s-trag nãpoi. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Fara tsi ari cãdzutã ntru schinji suntu atselji cai lu avdzãrã zborlu, ma, pri cali lji acatsã anasa angulcirili, avearili sh-chefea a banãljei sh-nu agiungã s-coacã. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Iarã simintsa tsi cãdzu tu loc bun suntu atselji tsi, dupã tsi lu ascultã zborlu, lu apãrã tu inimã tinjisitã sh-bunã sh-da carpo cu arãvdari.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cãndila tu Mãnali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Vãrã, dupã tsi ari apreasã cãndila, nu u-acoapirã cu vasã icã s-u bagã sum pat, ma u bagã pri mãnalea a ljei cu nãeti tsi atselji tsi intrã s-veadã lunjinã. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Cã nu ari tsiva ascumtu tsi nu va s-dizvãleascã, sh-vãrã tsiva ascumtu tsi nu va s-cunoascã sh-nu va easã tu lunjinã. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Trã atsea bãgats mintea cã cum ascultats, cã atsilui tsi ari, va lji si da sh-ma multu, iarã atsilui tsi nu ari, va lji si ljea sh-atsea tsi elu mindueashti cã u ari.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muma al Isus sh-Fratslji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Muma a lui sh-fratslji a lui vinirã la elu, ma nu putea tra s-aproachi trã itia a multsãmiljei. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Atumtsea niscãntsã lji dzãsirã: “Muma a ta sh-fratslji a tãlji suntu aclo nafoarã sh-vor s-ti veadã.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ma elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Muma a mea sh-fratslji a melji suntu atselji tsi ascultã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui sh-lu mplinescu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Acumtãni Vimtul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Tu unã di atseali dzãli Isusul intrã tu unã varcã cu ucenitsilji a lui sh-lã-dzãsi: “S-tritsem di napãrti a laclui.” Sh-elji s-dipãrtarã di aclo. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Tu chirolu tsi ma nãftea, Isusul lu acãtsã somnu. Un vimtu mari apãrnji pri lac, sh-varca ma s-umplea, sh-eara tu piricljiu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Atumtsea elji lji s-apruchearã, lu dishtiptarã sh-lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore, nvitsãtore ma nã nicãm!” Sh-elu s-dishtiptã, lji vãrghi a vimtului sh-a vãljiurilor turbati, sh-aesti tãcurã shi s-featsi buneatsã. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Apoea Isusul lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Iu easti pistea a voastrã?” Sh-elji lãhtãrsits sh-thãvmãtisits dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Cai va hibã aestu, tsi ordinã vimtul sh-apa sh-aesti lu ascultarã?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Un Om Demonizat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Deapoea nãftãsirã cãtrã loclu a Gherasenjilor, tsi easti agnanghea a Galileiljei. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Macãt Isusul dipunã tu loc, lj-ishi nãinti un om dit atsel cãsãbã, cai di multu chiro eara putut di dratslji, nu si nvishtea cu stranji sh-nu stãtea tu casã, ma prit murmintsã. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Cãndu vidzu cãtrã Isusul, sãlãghi unã zghiliri, lji s-arcã la cicioari sh-dzãsi cu boatsi analtã: “Tsi ari namisa di mini sh-di tini, Isuse, Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui atsilui Multu Analtu? Ts-fac rigeai nu mi tirãnsea!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Isusul ma lji dãdea ordin a duhlui nicurat s-ishea di la atsel om. Di multi ori lu avea putut sh-cu tutã cã lji avea ligatã cicioarili sh-mãnjili cu sinzhiri sh-cu prãnghi sh-lu vigljea, elu li arupea prãnghili shi s-pindzea di demonlu prit irnjii. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Atumtsea Isusul lu ntribã: “Cum u ai numa?” Sh-elu apãndisi: “Leghioni.” Cã multsã demonji avea intratã la nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Sh-elji s-ruga s-nu lji ursea s-dutsea tu ahãndami. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Atsia eara unã cupii mari di portsã cai pãshtea tu munti, sh-demonjlji aeshti s-rugarã s-dãdea volje s-intra pri nãshi. Elu lã deadi volje. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Atumtsea demonjlji, cum ishirã dit atsel om, intrarã la portsãlji sh-atsea cupii s-arcã di tu ripã tu lac shi s-nicã <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Cãndu vidzurã tsi undzi, atselji tsi vigljea portsãlji fudzirã sh-u scurpisirã hãbarea tu cãsãbã sh-prit hoari. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Atumtsea oaminjlji ishirã ti videari tsi avea undzitã sh-vinirã la Isusul. Aflarã omlu atsel, di la cai avea ishitã dratslji. Elu stãtea apunat la cicioarili a Isusului, nviscut sh-cu mintea sãnãtoasã sh-elji avurã fricã. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Atselji tsi vidzurã tsi s-featsi, lã aspusirã a lor cum eara vindicatã dracuitlu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Atumtsea, tut populu dit loclu a Gherasenjilor lji cãftã a Isusului s-fugã di la nãshi, cã lji avea acãtsat unã fricã mari. Sh-Isusul intrã tu varcã sh-fudzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Ashã omlu di la cai ishirã demonjlji, lj featsi rigeai s-armãnea cu nãsu, ma Isusul lu pitricu dzãcãnda: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Toarnã-ti la casa a ta shi aspun-lã cã tsi lucri buni ari faptã Dumnidzãlu trã tini.” Sh-elu s-dusi prit tuti pãrtsãli a cãsãbãlui aspunãnda ghinetsili tsi avea faptã Isusul trã nãsu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nyeadzã Unã Featã sh-Vindicã Unã Muljeari Lãndzitã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Sh-cãndu Isusul s-turnã, multsãmea lu ghini-ashtiptã cã tuts lu ashtipta. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Atumtsea vini un om cu numa Iair, tsi eara ma mari a sinagogãljei. Elu lji cãdzu la cicioari a Isusului sh-lji featsi rigeai s-njidzea la casa a lui. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Elu avea mash unã featã di vãrã doisprãdzatsi di anji, tsi eara trã moarti. Cãndu Isusul ma njidzea aclo, multsãmea ma s-pindzea anvãrliga di nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Unã muljeari tsi di doisprãdzatsi di anji lj-cura sãndzi, avea hãrgiuitã cu doctorlji tutã avearea a ljei, ni putut s-vindicã. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ea lji s-apruche di dinãpoi sh-bãgã mãna tu mardzina a stranjilui a lui sh-trãoarã dãnãsi curarea a sãndzilui. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Atumtsea Isusul ntribã: “Cai deadi di mini?” Dupã tsi tuts lu alipidarã, Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, multsãnjili ma s-pingã sh-ti anvãrligheadzã.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ma Isusul dzãsi: “Tsiniva deadi di mini sh-aduchii cã unã puteari ishi di la mini.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Atumtsea muljearea, vidzãnda cã nu putea s-ascundea, vini cu trimurari sh-cãdzu la cicioarili a lui. Ea dzãsi nãintea a tut popului, trã tse deadi di nãsu sh-cum eara vindicat trãoarã. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Sh-Isusul lji dzãsi: “Hilje, pistea a ta ti vindicã. Duti tu pace!” <verse eid="LUK 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Iarã Isusul ninga zbura, vini un di la casa al Iair, marli a sinagogãljei sh-lji dzãsi: “Hiljea a ta muri. Nu lu cãrtea ma Nvitsãtorlu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ma Isusul, dupã tsi avdzã aesti, lj-dzãsi: “Nu ti aspari! Tini mash pistipsea sh-ea va s-ascapã.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Cãndu agiumsi la casã, nu alãsã vãrã s-intrã, dicãt mash Petrul, Ioanul, Iacovul, tat-su sh-muma a featiljei. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Tuts plãndzea sh-vãita. Ma elu dzãsi: “Nu plãndzets! Ea nu ari moartã, ma doarmi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ma elji arãdea, shtinda cã avea muritã. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Atumtsea Isusul u acãtsã di mãnã sh-lji gri: “Featã, scoalã-ti!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />A ljei lji si turnã suflitlu sh-trãoarã si sculã. Apoea Isusul ursi s-lji da di mãcari. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Sh-pãrintsãlji a ljei armasirã ciudisits. Iarã Isusul lã dimãndã si nu lj-dzãtsea a vãrui cã tsi avea undzitã.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul lã Pitreatsi di Doisprãdzatslji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Isusul lã gri a doisprãdzatsilor ucenitsi a lui sh-lã deadi a lor puteari sh-autoritati pristi tuts dratslji shi s-vindicã niputerili. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Deapoea lji pitricu ti predicari amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui shi s-vindicã lãndzitslji. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu loats tsiva cu voi pri cali: nitsi ciumagã, nitsi trastã, nitsi pãni, nitsi pãradz sh-nitsiun di voi s-nu aibã cãti doauã tunitsi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Tu atsea casã iu va intrats, aclo stãtets pãnã cãndu s-fudzits di cãsãbã. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Macã vãrã nu vã aproachi, ishinda dit atsel cãsãbã, scuturats puhlu di cicioarili a voastri ca mãrtirii contra a lor.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Atumtsea elji s-nchisirã sh-pitrumsirã hoarili scurpisãnda evanghelu sh-vindicãnda iutsido.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Herodul Tulburat trã Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Herodul, tetrarclu, avdzã trã tuti lucrili tsi avea faptã shi s-tulburã, cã niscãntsã dzãtsea cã Ioanul eara nyeat dit mortsã. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Altsã dzãtsea cã si-eara aspusã Elia, sh-niscãntsã altsã cã eara nyeat un di prufitsilji di atselji vecljilji. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ma Herodul dzãsi: “A Ioanului mini lj-am tãljiatã caplu. Cai va hibã aestu, di la cai ma avdu ahtãri lucri?” Sh-cãfta s-lu videa.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Hrãneashti Tsintsi Njilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Cãndu s-turnarã ucenitsilji, lji aspusirã a Isusului tuti lucrili tsi elji avea faptã. Atumtsea elu lji lo cu nãsu shi s-trapsi nãparti tu un loc ermu la un cãsãbã tsi s-acljima Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Cãndu multsãnjili loarã di hãbari, s-dusirã dupã nãsu. Elu li ghini-ashtiptã sh-lã grea trã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui sh-vindica atselji tsi avea ananghi ti vindicari. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Cãndu dzua ma ascãpa, di doisprãdzatsi lji s-apruchearã al Isus sh-lji dzãsirã: “Nchisea multsãmea, tra s-neagã prit hoari sh-prit cãmpurili di anvãrliga, s-aflã streahã sh-hranã, cã aoa him tu un loc ermu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ma elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Dats-lã voi s-mãcã.” Elji apãndisirã: “Noi nu avem altã dicãt tsintsi pãnji sh-doi peshti, mash macã nidzem noi s-acumpãrãm hranã trã tuts aeshti oaminji.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Aclo eara vãrã tsintsi njilji di bãrbatsi. Ma elu lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Bãgats-lji s-sheadã mpadi tu buluchi cãti tsindzãtsi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Elji featsirã ashã sh-lji-apunarã tuts. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Atumtsea Isusul lo tsintsi pãnjili sh-doi peshtilji, sh-dupã tsi sculã ocljilji cãtrã tser, li ghinicuvãntã, li pãrtsã sh-li deadi a ucenitsilor a lui s-li dãdea a multsãmiljei. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Tuts mãcarã shi s-fãnãtirã, sh-di bucãtsili tsi armasirã adunarã doisprãdzatsi di coshuri.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul Aspuni cã Isusul Easti Hristolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Unã dzuã cãndu Isusul ma s-ruga tu singurami, ucenitsilji eara deadun cu nãsu. Sh-elu lji ntribã: “Cai dzãtsi populu cã escu mini?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Elji apãndisinda lji dzãsirã: “Niscãntsã dzãc Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu, altsã dzãc Elia, sh-altsã dzãc un di prufitsilji di atselji strãveclji tsi easti nyeat.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Sh-elu lji ntribã: “Ma voi, cai dzãtsets cã escu mini?” Atumtsea Petrul apãndisi: “Hristolu a Dumnidzãlui.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Prividzu Moartea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Atumtsea elu lã ursi cu aspru si nu apunã a vãrui, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />dzãcãnda: “Hiljilu a Omlui prindi s-patã multi, s-lu arniseascã aushlji, mãrlji a preftsilor sh-scriblji, s-lu vatãmã sh-a treia dzuã s-nyeadzã.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a tutulor: “Macã vãrã va hibã uceniclu a meu, si s-aleapid, s-u ljea cathi dzuã crutsea a lui shi s-mi urmeadzã. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Cã cai va u-ascapã bana a lui, va u chearã, ma cai va u chearã bana a lui trã mini, va u ascapã. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Tsi hãiri ari omlu ma s-amintã tutã lumea, sh-apoea s-chearã sh-elu shi s-ducã tu zãrari? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Cã, macã a vãrui lji yini arushini di mini sh-di zboarili a meali, sh-a Hiljilui a Omlui va lj-yinã arushini di nãsu, cãndu s-yinã tu mãrirea a lui sh-a Tatãlui sh-a sãmtsãlor anghilji. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã aoa suntu niscãntsã tsi nu va u veadã moartea, nãinti s-veadã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul sh-Lunjinarea a lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Sh-aproapi vãrã optu dzãli dupã tsi dzãsi aesti zboari, Isusul lo cu nãsu Petrul, Ioanul, Iacovul shi s-alinã pri munti trã rugari. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Sh-cãndu ma s-ruga, videarea a fatsãljei a lui alãxi sh-nvishtearea a lui s-featsi albã sh-lunjinatã. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Sh-ia, doi bãrbats ma zbura cu nãsu. Elji eara Moisiul sh-Elia, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />tsi s-aspusirã tu mãriri shi-zbura ti fudzirea a lui di aestã banã sh-tsi va s-fãtsea tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petrul sh-sotslji a lui eara bãgat tu somnu greu. Cãndu s-dishtiptarã, vidzurã mãrirea a lui sh-atselji doi bãrbats cai eara cu nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Sh-cãndu aeshti ma s-dipãrta di la nãsu, Petrul lj-dzãsi al Isus: “Nvitsãtore, trã noi easti ghini s-armãnem aoa, s-fãtsem trei tendi: unã trã tini, unã trã Moisiul sh-unã trã Elia,” ma elu nu shtia cã tsi dzãtsea. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Cãndu elu ma grea ashã, vini un nior tsi lji anvãli cu aumbra a lui, sh-ucenitsilji s-aspãrarã, cãndu intrarã tu nior. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Deapoea unã boatsi s-avdza dit nior dzãcãnda: “Aestu easti Hiljiu a meu aleptu, ascultats-lu!” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Sh-cãndu s-avdza aestã boatsi, Isusul s-aflã singur dip. Elji tãcurã sh-tu atseali dzãli nu lji aspusirã a vãrui di atseali tsi avea vidzutã.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Un Ficior Demonizat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Alantã dzuã, cãndu elji dipunarã dit munti, unã multsãmi mari di oaminji ishi nãintea al Isus. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Atumtsea un bãrbat di multsãmea ahurhii s-aurlã dzãcãnda: “Nvitsãtore, tsã fac rigeai, toarnã mutrita pri hiljiu a meu, cã easti singurlu tsi am. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Shi ia, un duh lu apucã sh-troarã elu zghileashti. Deapoea trimburã, scoati spumi sh-mizi fudzi di la elu, dupã tsi lu dirinã. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mi rugai a ucenitsilor a tãlji s-lu avinã, ma elji nu puturã.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Sh-Isusul apãndisinda, dzãsi: “O farã fãrã pisti sh-anapuda, pãnã cãndu va s-hiu cu voi sh-pãnã cãndu va s-vã aravdã? Adu-l aoatsi hiljiu a tãu!” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Cãndu cilimeanlu ma s-apruchea, draclu lu scuturã sh-lu dirinã. Ma Isusul lu vãrghi duhlu atsel nicuratlu, lu vindicã cilimeanlu sh-lji-lu deadi a tatãlui a lui.<verse eid="LUK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Prividzu di a Doaua Oarã Moartea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Tuts armasirã thãvmãtisits di mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui. Sh-cãndu tuts ma thãvmãtisea trã itsido tsi fãtsea Isusul, elu lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Bãgats-lã ghini tu minti aesti zboari: Hiljilu a Omlui va s-cadã tu mãnjili a oaminjlor.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ma elji nu li aduchirã aesti zboari. Aduchirea a lor eara ascumtu sh-trã aestã nu putea s-li aduchea sh-s-aspãrea s-lu ntriba trã atseali zboari.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cuvenda ntrã Ucenitsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Apoea namisa di elji ahurhi unã cuvendã: cai di nãshi va eara ma mari. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Atumtsea Isusul, shtinda cã tsi minduiri avea elji tu ininjli a lor, lo un cilimean njic sh-lu apruche ningã nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Apoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Atsel tsi lu aproachi aestu cilimean njicã tu numa a mea, mi aproachi mini. Atsel tsi mi aproachi mini, aproachi atsel tsi mi pitricu mini, cã atsel tsi easti ma njic di voi tuts, elu va hibã ma marli.” <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Atumtsea Ioanul luãnda zborlu dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, noi vidzum un om cai avina dratslji tu numa a ta sh-lu curmãm, cã elu nu ti urmeadzi deadun cu noi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ma Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Nu lu curmats, cã cai nu easti contra di voi, cu voi easti.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ncuntrarea di la Samaritenjilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Cãndu ma s-apruchea dzãlili tsi Isus prindea s-alina tu tser, elu apofãsi s-ducã tu Ierusalem, <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />sh-pitricu nãinti hãbãrsitorlji. Aeshti, s-nchisirã sh-intrarã tu unã hoarã a Samaritenjilor tra s-lji etimãseascã yinearea. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ma atselji di hoarã nu vrurã s-lu apruchea, cã elu imna cãtrã Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Cãndu lu vidzurã aestã, ucenitsilji a lui Iacovul sh-Ioanul dzãsirã: “Doamne, vrei tini tsi s-dzãtsem s-dipunã foc dit tser shi s-lji upureascã?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ma elu s-turnã cãtrã elji sh-lji vãrghi. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Deapoea s-dusirã tu unã altã hoarã.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S-urmedzi Isusul custiseashti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Cãndu elji ma imna pri cali, un lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, mini va ti urmedz iutsido tsi s-ti duts.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Ma Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Vulchili au gãvrili sh-puljilji a tserlui fuljeauã, iarã Hiljiu a Omlui nu ari iu s-andoapirã caplu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Deapoea lji dzãsi a unui altu: “Urmeadzã-mi!” Ma elu lj-apãndisi: “Doamne, dã-nji volje ma nãinti s-mi duc s-ngropã tatã-nju.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Isusul lji dzãsi: “Alasã mortsãlji s-lji ngroapã mortsãlji a lor. Iarã tini imnã sh-preadicã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui!” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Un altu lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, mini va ti urmedz tini, ma dã-nji volje ma nãinti s-mi dispartu cu Fumealja a mea.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Vãrã tsi ari bãgatã mãna tu paramandã sh-mutreashti nãpoi, nu easti axiu trã huzmitipsiri tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Pitreatsi Shaptidzãtsi sh-Doi di Ucenjitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Dupã aesti Domnul numi shaptidzãtsidoi altsã sh-lji nchisi doi cãti doi nãintea a lui tu cathi cãsãbã sh-loc, iu elu va njidzea. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Sh-lã dzãsi a-lor: “Sitsirarea easti multã, ma lucrutorlji suntu putsãnji. Rugats-vã a Domnului a sitsirariljei s-pitreacã lucrutori la sitsirarea a lui. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Dutsets-vã! Ia, mini ma vã pitrec ca njelji namisa di luchi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nu loats nitsi pungã, nitsi trastã, nitsi sandali. Pri cali nu vã salutats cu vãrã. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Tu cathi casã tsi va intrats, ma nãinti dzãtsets: ‘Pacea tu aestã casã!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Sh-macã easti atsia un hiljiu a paciljei, pacea a voastrã va dipunã pristi nãsu, macã nu, va s-toarnã la voi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Armãnets tu atsea casã. Mãcats sh-bets di atseali tsi va vã da, cã lucrutorlu easti axiu trã plata a lui. Nu imnats di la unã casã tu alanta. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Tu itsi cãsãbã iu va intrats sh-vã ghini-ashteaptã, mãcats tsi vã bagã nãinti. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Vindicats lãndzitslji tsi va hibã aclo sh-dzãtsets-lã a lor: ‘Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui easti ningã voi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ma, macã intrats tu vãrã cãsãbã sh-nu vã ghini-ashteaptã, ishits prit cãljuri sh-dzãtsets: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Noi ma scuturãm sh-pulbirlu a cãsãbãlui a vostru tsi nã s-alãchi. Ma voi si shtits cã Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui easti aproapi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mini vã dzãc cã atsea dzuã trã Sodom va hibã ma lishor dicãt atsel cãsãbã. <verse eid="LUK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Cavai di tini Corazin! Cavai di tini Betsaida! Cã ma s-eara faptã tu Tiro sh-tu Sidon thavmatili tsi s-featsirã la voi, elji di cu chiro va s-eara mitãnjiusits, nviscuts cu sac sh-apunats tu cinushi. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Trã atsea, giudicata trã Tiro sh-Sidon va hibã ma lishor dicãt trã voi. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Sh-tini Capernaum, cum mindueshti cã ti anãltsashi pãnã tu tser? Tini va ti ahãnduseshti pãnã tu Colasi. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Cai vã ascultã voi, mi ascultã mini. Cai vã arniseashti voi, mi arniseashti mini. Cai mi arniseashti mini, arniseashti atsel tsi mi pitricu mini.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Shaptidzãtsidoi di ucenitsi s-turnarã cu harauã sh-dzãsirã: “Doamne, sh-demonjlji nã si sumpun tu numa a ta.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Mini lu vidzui Satanlu cãdzãnda dit tser ca un sfulgu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ia, vã am dat autoritati s-ncãlcats pristi nãpãrtitsi sh-scrachi sh-pri itsi fuchii a neamiclui, sh-tsiva nu va vã zãrãseascã. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Cu tut atsea, nu vã hãrsits cã duhurili ma vã si sumpun, ma hãrsits-vã ma multu cã numili a voastri suntu scriati tu tser.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Tu atsea oarã Isusul s-umplu cu harauã prit Duhlu Sãmtu sh-dzãsi: “Mini ti alavdu, Tatãl, Domnul a tserlui sh-a loclui, cã li ascumseshi aesti a mintimenjilor sh-a shtiutslor, sh-u discupirish la cilimenjlji atselji njitsi. Ie, Tate, cã ashã ts-arãsi a tsãea. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Itsido nji easti datã di la Tatãl a meu, sh-vãrã nu shtii cai easti Hiljilu, dicãt mash Tatãl sh-vãrã nu shtii cai easti Tatãl, dicãt mash Hiljilu sh-atsilui tsi Hiljilu aleadzi s-lu discoapirã.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Deapoea s-turnã cãtrã ucenitsilji sh-lã dzãsi dinãparti a lor: “Ca hara di ocljilji cai ved atseali tsi videts voi. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ma vã dzãc cã multsã prufits sh-amiradzi vrurã s-videa atsea tsi ma videts voi, ma nu u vidzurã, shi s-avdã atseali tsi ma avdzãts voi, ma nu li avdzãrã.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Bunlui Samaritan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Atumtsea un mastru a legiljei si sculã tsi s-bãga tu provã Isusul sh-lji dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, tsi prindi s-fac tsi s-mushtinescu bana eternã?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Sh-Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Tsi easti scriatã tu lege? Cum u cãntsã?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Elu lj-apãndisi: “S-vrei Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a tãu cu tutã inima a ta, cu tut suflitlu a tãu, cu tutã fuchia a ta, sh-cu tutã minduirea a ta, shi s-vrei aproapili a tãu ca cum ti vrei tini.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Apãndisishi ndreptu. Fã aestã sh-va s-bãnedz!” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ma elu vrãnda s-lji aspunea cã easti ndreptu, lj-dzãsi al Isus: “Cai easti aproapili a meu?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Atumtsea Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Un om dipunã dit Ierusalem cãtrã Ierico sh-cãdzu tu mãnjili a furilor. Elji lu dispuljearã, lu featsirã cu pledzi, s-dipãrtarã sh-lu alãsarã aproapi di moarti. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Chiui tsi un preftu, dipunãnda tu atsea cali, vidzu omlu sh-tricu cãtrã alantã parti. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Tut ashã sh-un Levit, cãndu agiumsi la atsel loc, vini l-vidzu sh-tricu cãtrã alantã parti. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ma un Samaritan, tsi ma cãlãtorea lji s-apruche sh-cãndu lu vidzu aspusi njilã. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Vini la elu, lj-arcã untulem sh-yin sh-lji ligã pledzili. Deapoea l-bãgã pri pravda a lui, lu dusi tu unã hani sh-lji featsi huzmeti. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Alantã dzuã, scoasi doi denari sh-lji li deadi a hãngiului dzãcãnda: ‘Fã huzmeti a lui sh-cãti pãradzi va s-hãrgiueshti va ts-li dau cãndu va mi tornu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Cai di aeshti trelji tsã si pari cã s-featsi aproapili atsilui tsi cãdzu tu mãnjili a furilor?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Sh-elu apãndisi: “Omlu tsi aspusi njilã trã nãsu.” Atumtsea Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Duti sh-fã ashãtsi sh-tini!”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">La Casa ali Martii sh-ali Marii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Chiui tsi cãndu elji ma cãlãtorea, Isusul intrã tu unã hoarã, sh-unã muljeari cu numa Marta lu ashtiptã la casa a ljei. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marta avea unã sorã tsi s-acljima Maria. Ea stãtu la cicioarili al Isus sh-avdza nvitsãtura a lui. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ma Marta eara apucat cu lucrili a etimãsiriljei sh-dupã tsi lji s-apruche lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, nu vrei s-shtii cã sora a mea mi alãsã singur s-fac huzmeti? Dzã-lji s-mi agiutã!” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Domnul lj-apãndisi: “Marta, Marta, tini eshti apucatã sh-munduitã cu multi lucri. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ma unã easti di ananghi. Maria aleapsi partea atsea ma buna, tsi nu va lji si mutã.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Nvitsãtura al Isus trã Rugari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Isusul ma s-ruga tu un loc. Cãndu ascãpã, un di ucenitsilji a lui lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, nveats-nã s-rugãm, ashã cum nvitsã sh-Ioanul ucenitsilji a lui.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi: “Cãndu s-vã rugats, dzãtsets:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tate, si sãmtseascã numa a ta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">s-yinã amirãriljea a ta!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Dã-nã di cathi dzuã pãnea a noastrã.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Sh-nã ljeartã amãrtiili a noastri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">cã sh-noi lji ljirtãm amãrtioshlji a noshtri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Sh-nu nã alasã s-cãdem tu cãrteari.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Deapoea lã dzãsi: “S-dzãtsem cã un di voi tsi ari un oaspi s-dutsi njeadzãnoapti la casa a lui sh-lji dzãtsi: ‘Oaspe, dã-nji trei pãnji mprumut, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />cã nj-ari vinit di pri cali un oaspi sh-nu am tsiva s-lji bagã nãinti.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Sh-elu di nãuntru apãndiseashti: ‘Nu mi cãrtea. Usha tora easti ncljisã sh-cilimenjlji a melji suntu tu ashtirnutu cu mini. Nu pot s-mi scol shi s-tsã dau.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Mini ma vã dzãc, cu tutã cã nu va si scoalã sh-nu va s-lji da tsiva cã easti oaspili a lui, elu va si scoalã trã itia a cãftariljei fãrã arushini, sh-va lji da cãti lj-lipseashti. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Trã atsea ma vã dzãc: Pricãdetz sh-va vã si-da! Cãftats shi va aflats! Asunats sh-va vã si discljidã. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Cã cai pricadi, ljea, cai caftã, aflã, sh-atsilui tsi asunã va lji si discljidã. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Cai di voi easti ahtar tatã, tsi macã ficiorlu s-lji caftã un pescu, s-lji da nãpãrticã? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Icã ma s-lji caftã un ou, s-lji da un scrap? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Macã voi tsi hits arãi, shtits s-dats doari buni a hiljilor a voshtri, multu ma multu Tatãl a vostru tu tseruri va da Duhlu Sãmtu atsilor tsi lj-pricadã!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul sh-Belzebubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Isusul ma aĝunea un demon di la un om tsi eara mut. Cãndu lj-ishi demonlu, mutlu zburã sh-multsãmea s-ciudisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ma niscãntsã di atselji dzãsirã: “Elu lji aĝuneashti demonjlji cu fuchia al Belzebul, primarlu a demonjilor.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Altsã tra s-lu bãga tu provã, lj-cãfta a lui un semnu dit tser. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ma Isusul, cunuscãnda minduirili a lor, lã dzãsi: “Cathi amirãrilji dispãrtsat di nãuntru si shcretueashti sh-cathi casã dispãrtsatsã va cadã. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Macã sh-Satanlu easti dispãrtsãt di nãuntru, cum va si s-tsãnã amirãriljea a lui? Mini vã ntribai cã voi dzãtsets tsi mini lji aĝunescu demonjlji cu Belzebul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Macã mini lji aĝunescu demonjlji cu Belzebul, cu cai lji aĝunescu demonjlji urmãtorilji a voshtri? Trã atsea elji va-hibã giudicãtorlji a voshtri. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Macã mini lji aĝunescu demonjlji cu dzeaditlu a Dumnidzãlui, amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui ari agiumtã la voi. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Cãndu un om vãrtos sh-ãrmãtusit u-veaglji ghini casa a lui, avearea a lui easti siguripsitã. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ma cãndu yini un ma vãrtos di elu, alumtãseashti cu nãsu sh-amintã, atsel lji ljea armili la cai avea nãdii sh-li partsã plecichli a lui. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Cai nu easti cu mini, easti contra di mini, sh-cai nu adunã cu mini, dispartsã.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Cãndu duhlu nicurat easi di la omlu, imnã prit locuri shcreti fãrã apã, cãftãnda arihati, sh-cãndu nu-u aflã, dzãtsi: ‘Va mi tornu tu casa a mea di iu ishii.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Sh-cãndu yini, u-aflã arnitã shi stulsitã. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Atumtsea s-dutsi sh-ljea cu nãsu shapti duhuri alti ma arãi di nãsu, sh-elji intrã sh-bãneadzã aclo. Ashãtsi starea di ma napoi a omlui s-fatsi ma arãu di atsea di ma nãinti.” <verse eid="LUK 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Cãndu ma dzãtsea aesti zboari, unã muljeari di multsãmea sculãnda boatsea dzãsi: “Ca hara di pãnticlu tsi ti tsãnu sh-tsãtsa tsi ti hrãni.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ma Isusul lã dzãsi: “Ma ghini ca hara di atselji tsi ascultã zborlu al Dumnidzãu shi lu fac.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Semnul a Prufitlui Iona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Iarã multsãmea ma s-adãvga, Isusul ahurhi s-dzãcã: “Aestã farã easti arauã. Ea caftã un semnu, ma a ljei nu va lji si da, dicãt semnul a prufitlui Iona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Cã ashã ca Iona fu un semnu trã Niniveanjlji, ashã sh-Hiljiu a Omlui va hibã un semnu trã aestã farã. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Amirãroanjea di Sud va si scoalã la giudicatã deadun cu oaminjlji a farãljei aishtei sh-va lji giudicã, cã ea vini dit mardzina a loclui trã avdzãri mintimeniljea al Solomon. Sh-ia, aoa easti un ma mari dicãt Solomonlu. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Niniveanjlji, va si scoalã la giudicatã cu atsea gheneratã sh-va l-giudicã, cã elji s-mitãnjiusirã cãndu Iona predicã. Sh-ia, aoa easti un ma mari dicãt prufitlu Iona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lunjina a Truplui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Vãrã nu aprindi cãndila shi s-lu bagã tu un loc ascumtu icã sum unã cofã. Ea s-bagã pristi un purtãtor di lunjinã, tsi s-veadã atselji tsi va intrã. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Lunjina a truplui a tãu easti ocljiul. Macã ocljiul a tãu easti curat, tut truplu a tãu va hibã lunjinat, ma macã ocljiul a tãu easti arãu, sh-truplu a tãu va hibã tu scutidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Trã atsea s-ai cãshtiga tsi lunjina tsi easti la tini s-nu hibã scutidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Macã truplu a tãu easti lunjinat sh-fãrã unã chicutã di scutidi, va hibã iutsido lunjinatã, ashãtsi cum s-fatsi, cãndu lunjina ti lunjineadzã cu strãlutsirea a ljei.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vãrghirea a Fariseilor sh-a Nvitsãtorilor di Lege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Cãndu Isusul ascãpã zburarea, un Fariseu lu acljimã di prãndzari la casa a lui. Elu intrã sh-s-apunã la measã. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Fariseul s-ciudisi cãndu vidzu Isusul tsi nu aspilã mãnjili nãinti di mãcari. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Atumtsea Domnul lj-dzãsi: “Tora voi Farisei curats partea di nafoarã a cupãljei sh-a tipsiiljei, iarã voi di nãuntru hits mplin di arãchiri sh-di arãutati. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Zurlji! Atsel tsi featsi partea di nafoarã, vahi nu featsi sh-atsea di nãuntru? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Trã atsea, dats dit inimã atsilor tsi au ananghi, sh-ashãtsi tuti va hibã curati trã voi. <verse eid="LUK 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Ma cavai di voi, Farisei! Voi plãtits a dzatsea parti di mentã, di yiazmã, sh-di cathi virdeatsã, ma-alãsats dupã mãnã ndriptatea sh-vrearea a Dumnidzãlui. Aesti prindi s-li fãtsets sh-alantãli s-nu li alãsats. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Cavai di voi, Farisei! Voi vrets protili locuri tu sinagogã sh-ncljinãciunji prit pãdzi. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Cavai di voi, cã hits ca murmintsãlji fãrã seamni, sh-oaminjlji imnã prisuprã fãrã si shtibã.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dupã legea cãndu cãrteshti un murmintu ti fats nichischin, ti lãvusheashti.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Un nvitsãtor di lege apãndisi: “Nvitsãtore, dzãcãnda aesti, tini ma nã rushinedzi sh-noi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Sh-Isusul dzãsi: “Cavai di-voi, nvitsãtori di lege! Cã lji ncãrcats oaminjlji cu ncãrcãturi greali, ma voi idhyilji nu bãgats nitsi dzeaditlu la aestã ncãrcãturã. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Cavai di voi! Cã voi adrat murmintsãlji a prufitsilor tsi pãrintsãlji a voshtri lji vãtãmarã. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ashãtsi voi mãrtirsits sh-pricunushtets faptili a pãrintsãlor a voshtri, cã elji lji vãtãmarã sh-voi adrats murmintsãlji a lor. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Trã atsea mintimeniljea a Dumnidzãlui dzãsi: ‘Mini va vã pitrec prufits sh-apostulji, sh-elji va s-vatãmã niscãntsã di nãshi sh-altsãlji va lji priaĝuneascã.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ashãtsi aestã farã s-ljea cãbãtsili trã sãndzili virsatã a tuts prufitsilor di tu apãrnjita a lumiljei, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />di la sãndzili al Abel pãnã la sãndzili al Zaharia, tsi lu vãtãmarã namisa di altarlu sh-di templu. Trã atsea mini ma vã dzãc cã di la aestã farã va si s-caftã lugurii. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Cavai di voi, nvitsãtori di lege! Cã voi u loatã cljeaia a shtintsãljei. Ashãtsi voi idyilji nu intrat sh-avets nchidicat sh-atselji tsi ma intra.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Cãndu Isusul ishi afoarã di aclo, scriblji sh-Fariseilji ahurhirã s-ncuntreadzã multu shi s-lu ambuliseascã cu ma multi ntribãri. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Deapoea elji ashtipta tsi s-lu acãtsa cu vãrã zbor tsi va s-dzãtsea dit gura a lui.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Prispuneari sh-Urnipsiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Tu atsel chiro s-adunarã njilji di oaminji, ahãtu cãt ma ncãlca un-alantu. Isusul nãinti di tuti apãrnji s-lã dzãcã a ucenitsilor a lui: “Afirits-vã di maeaua a Fariseilor, tsi easti ipucrizia. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Nu easti tsiva anvãlitã tsi nu va s-dizvãleascã sh-ascumtu tsi nu va s-cunoascã. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Trã atsea itsido tsi avets dzãsã tu scutidi, va si s-avdã tu lunjinã, sh-atseali tsi avets pushpurat tu ureclji pri udãdzi cu ushi ncljisi, va s-dimãndã prit citiili a cãsilor. <verse eid="LUK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Ma vã dzãc a voauã, oaspits a melji, tsi s-nu avets fricã di atselji tsi vatãmã truplu sh-dupã atsea nu pot s-facã tsiva altã. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Mini va vã aspun di la cai s-avets fricã. Afirits-vã di atsel tsi, dupã tsi hits vãtãmat, ari autoritati s-vã arucã tu Colasi. Ie, ma vã dzãc, di aestu s-avets fricã. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Nu si s-vindu tsintsi harabelji di doauã pãradz? Cu tut atsea, vãrã di elji nu easti agãrshitã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ninga sh-perlji a caplui a vostru suntu tuti numirats. Trã atsea s-nu avets fricã. Voi axiusits ma multu di harabelji. <verse eid="LUK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Mini ma vã dzãc: Caitsido tsi mi mãrtirseashti mini nãintea a oaminjlor, sh-Hiljiu a Omlui va s-mãrtirseascã nãintea a anghilor a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ma atsel tsi va mi aleapidã nãintea a oaminjlor, va hibã alipidat nãintea a anghilor a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Caitsido tsi va greascã contra a Hiljilui a Omlui va lji si ljeartã, ma atsel tsi va blastimã contra a Duhlui Sãmtu, nu va lji si ljeartã. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Cãndu va vã ducã nãintea a sinagodzilor, la domnjitorlji sh-la administratorlji, s-nu avets mirachi cã cum va vã apãrats icã tsi prindi s-dzãtsets. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Duhlu Sãmtu va vã nveatsã cã tsi s-dzãtsets tu oara atsea.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Avutlui Glar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Atumtsea un dit multsãmea lj-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, dzã-lji a fratilui a meu si mpartã mushtinirea cu mini.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Oaspe, cai mi bãgã mini giudicãtor icã mpãrtsãtor trã voi?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “S-avets cãshtigã sh-afirits-vã di orixea trã aveari, cã bana a omlui nu easti ligat di avearea atsea marea a lui.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Atumtsea elu lã aspusi unã parabolã: “Agrul a unui avut deadi multu birichet. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ashãtsi elu s-minduea cu mintea a lui: ‘Tsi s-fac, cã nu am loc iu s-adun birichetea?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Deapoea dzãsi: ‘Aestã va fac: Va s-aspargu hãmbãrili a meali sh-va fac niscãnti ma mãri. Aclo va adun tut birichetea sh-tuti bunãtãtsili a meali. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Deapoea va lj-dzãc a suflitlui a meu: “Suflite, tini ai multi bunãtãts adunati trã multsã anji. Tora discurmã-ti, mãcã, bea sh-hãrsea-ti!”’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ma Dumnidzãlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Glare! Aestã noapti suflitlu a tãu va s-caftã, ma atseali tsi ndripseshi a cui va hibã?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ashã lj-undzeashti atsilui tsi adunã ayishteari trã nãsu sh-nu easti avut cãtrã Dumnidzãlu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S-Nu Avets Gaile!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Deapoea lã-dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Trã atsea ma vã dzãc: Nu vã minduits trã bana a voastrã cã tsi va mãcats, nitsi di truplu a vostru cã tsi va nvishtetsã. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Bana easti ma multu dicãt hrana sh-truplu ma multu dicãt nvishtearea. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mutrits-lji corghilji: Atselji nitsi seaminã, nitsi seatsirã, nu au nitsi grãnar sh-nitsi hãmbar, sh-Dumnidzãlu lji hrãneashti. Ma voi custusits multu ma multu dicãt puljilji. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Cai di voi, cu tut cãshtiga a lui poati s-adavgã bana a lui unã oarã ma multã? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Atumtsea, macã nu putets s-adrats njitsi lucri, cãtse vã mealã trã alti? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mutrits cum crescu zãmbãtslji. Nu lucreadzã sh-nitsi nu torcu, cu tut atsea, mini ma vã dzãc cã nitsi Solomonul tu tutã mãrirea a lui, nu eara nviscutã ca un di zãmbãtslji. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Atumtsea, macã Dumnidzãlu nveashti iarba a cãmpului tsi azã easti sh-mãni s-arucã tu cireap, cãt ma multu Dumnidzãlu vã nveashti voi, putsãn-pistimenji! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Nu mutrits tsi va mãcats sh-tsi va bets. S-nu avets gaile! <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Natsiunili a lumiljei li caftã tuti aesti, ma Tatãl a vostru lu shtii cã voi avets ananghi di eali. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Cãftats ma nãinti amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu sh-tuti aesti va vã si adavgã. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Nu ti-aspari, cupii njicã, cã a Tatãlui a vostru lj-arsi s-vã da amirãriljea. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Vindets ayishtearili a voastri sh-dats a niavutslor! Fãtsets trã voi pundzi tsi nu s-nvicljeadzã, unã ayishteari tu tseruri tsi nu va ascapã, iu furlu nu s-aproachi sh-molitsa nu u-aroadi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Cã aclo iu easti ayishtearea a voastrã, aclo va hibã sh-inima a voastrã.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bãgats Oarã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Etimãsits-vã trã huzmitipsiri sh-aprindets cãndila. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />S-hits ca atselji, tsi ashteaptã nicuchirlu a lor, tsi va si s-toarnã di la numtã, tsi cãndu s-yinã shi s-asunã la ushã, trãoarã s-lji-u discljidets. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ca hara di atselji huzmicheari, tsi cãndu si s-toarnã nicuchirlu, lji aflã dishtiptats! Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã elu va si s-nveascã trã huzmeti, va lji apunã atselji la measã, va yinã aproapi sh-va lji chirãseascã. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Sh-macã yini tu njeadzãnoapti icã dimineatsa tu apiritã, shi s-lji aflã ashãtsi, ca hara di atselji huzmicheari. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />S-u shtits aestã, cã macã va-u shtia nicuchirlu a casãljei tu tsi oarã va yinea furlu, nu va alãsa atsel s-lji aspãrdzea casa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Sh-voi s-hits etinji, cã Hiljiu a Omlui yini tu atsea oarã tsi nu lu ashtiptats.” <verse eid="LUK 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, aestã parabolã ma u-dzãtsi mash trã noi, ama trã tuts?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Domnul apãndisi: “Cai easti atsel administrator pistimen sh-mintimen, tsi va lu-bagã nicuchirlu pristi huzmichearlji a lui tra s-lã da a lor tãimea tu chirolu tsi prindi? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ca hara di atsel huzmichear tsi cãndu va yinã nicuchirlu a lui, va lu aflã adrãnda ashã. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã elu va lu bagã pristi tuti ayishtearili a lui. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ma, macã atsel huzmichear mindueashti tu inima a lui: ‘Nicuchirlu a meu amãnã si s-toarnã,’ sh-ahurheashti s-lji batã huzmichearlji sh-huzmichearli, s-mãcã, s-bea shi si s-mbeatã, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />atumtsea nicuchirlu atsilui huzmichear va yinã tu dzua tsi nu lu ashteapti, sh-tu oara tsi nu u-shtii, sh-va lu facã bãcãtsã sh-partea a lui va u-bagã cu nipistimenjlji. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Ma atsel huzmichear, cai shtia vrearea a nicuchirlui a lui sh-nu s-etimãsi sh-nu featsi dupã vrearea a nicuchirlui, va si s-batã multu. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ma atsel, tsi nu u-shtia sh-featsi lucri tsi prindi si s-batã, va si s-batã niheamã. A cui lji si ari datã multu, va lji si caftã multu. A cui lji si pistipsi multu, va lji si caftã ma multu. <verse eid="LUK 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Mini vinj s-aruc foc pristi loc sh-cãtã multu voi tsi foclu s-eara apreasã tora. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Am un pãtigiuni trã pãtidzari sh-nu escu arihati pãnã cãndu s-u fac. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Minduits cã vinj s-aducã pace pristi loc? Nu vã dzãc, ma dispãrtsãri. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Di tora sh-nclo, tsintsi oaminji tu unã casã va hibã dispãrtsãts, trei contra a doilor sh-doi contra a treilor. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tatãl va hibã dispãrtsat di hiljilu, sh-hiljilu di tatãlu, muma di hiljea sh-hiljea di muma, soacra di nveasta sh-nveasta di soacra a ljei.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aduchirea a Chirolui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a multsãnjilor: “Cãndu voi videts un nior tsi si scoalã dit ascãpitat, trãoarã dzãtsets: ‘Ma yini ploaia,’ sh-ashã easti. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Cãndu suflã dit sud, voi dzãtsets: ‘Va facã cãloari,’ sh-ashã easti. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Ipucrits! Voi aduchits fatsa a loclui sh-a tserlui, ma chirolu di tora cum nu putets s-lu aduchits? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Cãtse nu giudicats voi singuri tsi easti ndreptu? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Cãndu tini nedzi cu contrarlu a tãu la giudicãtorlu, s-caftsã pri cali tsi s-ti uidiseshti cu nãsu, tsi contrarlu s-nu ti scoatã nãintea a giudicãtorlui, sh-giudicãtorlu s-ti prida la gardianlu sh-elu s-ti bagã tu hapsi. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Mini ma ts-dzãc, cã tini nu va eshi di aclo, ni plãtitã sh-sutarlu dit soni.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mitãnjusiri icã Chireari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Tu oara atsea vinirã niscãntsã oaminji la Isusul sh-lji aspusirã trã Galileanjilji, tsi sãndzili a cãror Pilatul lu avea misticat cu curbãnjlji a lor. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Isusul lji ntribã: “Minduits voi cã atselji Galileanji eara ma mãri amãrtioshi dicãt alantsã Galileanji? Trã atsea pãtsãrã aestã? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Mini ma vã dzãc, nu! Ma, macã nu vã mitãnjusits, sh-voi tutashã va murits tuts. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Minduits voi cã atselji optusprãdzatsi pristi cai cãdzu cula al Shiloam sh-lji vãtãmã, eara cãbãetsi ma mãri dicãt bãnãtorlji al Ierusalem? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Mini ma vã dzãc, nu! Ma, macã voi nu vã mitãnjusits sh-voi tutashã va murits.” <verse eid="LUK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Atumtsea Isusul aspusi aestã parabolã: “Un om avea un hic siminat tu ayinjea a lui. Elu vini sh-cãftã frut, ma nu aflã. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Atumtsea lj-dzãsi a ayinjearlui: ‘Ia, am trei anji tsi caftu frut la aestu hic sh-nu ma aflu. Talji-l! Cãtse s-acatsã loclu digeaba?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ma ayinjearlu lj-apãndisi: ‘Doamne, alasu-l sh-aestu an, s-lu prãshescu di-anvãrliga shi s-lj-arucã cuprii. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Vahi da frut anlu tsi yini. Macã nu va da, atumtsea talji-l.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Sãmbãta Muljearea Atsea Sãcata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Unã Sãmbãtã Isusul ma nvitsa tu sinagogã. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Shi ia, aclo eara unã muljeari, tsi di optusprãdzatsi di anji eara putut di un duh, sh-ea eara cãmburã sh-nu putea cu tsiva s-ndripta truplu. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Isusul u vidzu, u acljima ningã nãsu sh-lji dzãsi: “Muljeari eshti vindicatã di lãngoarea a ta.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Apoea bãgã mãnjili pristi nãsã, sh-ea trãoarã si ndriptã sh-alãvdã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Atumtsea marli a sinagogãljei nãrãit cã Isusul avea vindicatã tu dzua di Sãmbãtã, lji gri a multsãmiljei: “Shasi suntu dzãlili cãndu omlu prindi s-lucreadzã. Yinits s-vã vindicats tu atseali dzãli, nu tu dzua di Sãmbãtã.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Atumtsea Domnul lj-apãndisi: “Ipucrits! Vahi nu s-dizleagã dit grajdu boulu icã gumarlu tu dzua di Sãmbãtã sh-cathi un di voi s-lji da apã ti beari? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ma aestã hiljea al Abraham tsi eara di optusprãdzatsi di anji ligatã di Satanlu, nu prindea s-dizliga di atseli prãnghi tu dzua di Sãmbãtã?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Dupã tsi li dzãsi aeasti zboari, tuts atselji tsi eara contra a lui armasirã arushinats, iarã multsãmea s-hãrsea trã tuti lucrili atseali thãvmãtisiti tsi elu avea faptã.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola al Gãrnutsu di Sinap sh-a Mãeauãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Atumtsea Isusul ntribã: “A cui lj-undzeashti amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui? Cu tsi s-u undzescu? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ea undzeashti cu un gãrnuts di sinapi, tsi un om lu lo sh-lu arcã tu grãdina a lui. Gãrnutslu criscu shi s-featsi cãt un pom. Puljilji a tserlui fãtsea fuljeauã tu dedzili a lui.” <verse eid="LUK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Deapoea ntribã nãpoi: “Cu tsi s-u undzescu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ea undzeashti cu mãeaua tsi ljea unã muljeari sh-u minteashti cu trei misuri di fãrinã pãnã cãndu aloatlu s-yinã ghini.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usha Atsea Strimta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Sh-Isusul ma tritsea cãsãbadzi sh-hoari, sh-ashã nvitsãnda ma s-apruchea la Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Un om lu ntribã: “Doamne, suntu putsãnji atselji tsi va s-ascapã?” Elu lã dzãsi a-lor: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Munduits-vã s-intrats prit usha atsea strimta, cã mini ma vã dzãc, cã multsã va caftã s-intrã, ma nu va s-poatã. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Cãndu nicuchirlu a casiljei easti sculat shi u-ari ncljisã usha, atumtsea voi tsi avets armas nafoarã, va s-ahurhits s-asunats pri ushã, dzãcãnda: ‘Doamne, discljidi-nã.’ Ma elu apãndisinda va vã dzãcã: ‘Nu vã cunoscu di iu hits.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Atumtsea va apãrnjits s-dzãtsets: ‘Noi mãcãm sh-bium deadun cu tini shi tini nã nvitsash tu cãljurili a noastri.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ma elu va vã dzãcã: ‘Mini nu vã shtiu di iu yinits. Dipãrtats-vã di la mini tuts voi arãu-fãcãtori!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Aclo va hibã plãngul sh-cãrtsãnirea a dintsilor, cãndu va videts Abrahamul, Isacul, Iacovul sh-tuts prufitsilji tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui, ma voi va vã scoatã nafoarã. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Atumtsea va yinã dit rãsãrit sh-dit ascãpitat, dit nord sh-dit sud sh-va s-apunã la measã tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Sh-ia, atselji di soni va-hibã protslji, sh-atselji protslji va-hibã tu coadã.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvirinarea al Isus trã Ierusalemlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Tu atsea dzuã niscãntsã Farisei vinirã sh-lji dzãsirã al Isus: “Eshi sh-dipãrtedzã-ti di aoatsi, cã Herodul caftã s-ti vatãmã.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Elu lã apãndisi a lor: “Dutsets-vã sh-lji dzãtsets a vulpili atsiljei: ‘Ia, azã sh-mãni ma aĝunescu demonjlji sh-ma vindicã, sh-tu a-treia dzuã ma l-bitisescu lucrul a meu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Cu tutã atsea, azã, mãni sh-pãimãni prindi s-imnã, cã nu poati tsi un prufit s-moarã nafoarã di Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Ierusalem, Ierusalem, tini tsi vatsãnji prufitsilji sh-cu chetri vatsãnji pitricutslji a Dumnidzãlui! Di cãti ori am vrut s-adunã hiljilji a tãlji, ashã ca clocea tsi aduni puljilji sum areapitli a ljei, ma voi nu vrut! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ia, casa a voastrã va s-armãnã shcretã. Mini ma vã dzãc cã nu va mi videts ma, pãnã cãndu s-yinã chirolu s-dzãtsets: ‘Ghinicuvintat easti atsel tsi yini tu numa a Domnului.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ps 118:26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul la Casa a Fariseului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Unã Sãmbãtã, cãndu Isusul s-dusi la casa a unui di mãrlji a Fariseilor tra s-mãcã, elji ma lu vigljea. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Aclo nãintea al Isus eara un om lãndzit cu idropizii. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Isusul lji ntribã nvitsãtorlji a legiljei sh-Fariseilji: “Easti volje trã vindicari dzua di Sãmbãtã?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ma elji tãcurã. Atumtsea Isusul lo di mãnã nipututlu, lu vindicã sh-lu alãsã s-fugã. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Deapoea, lã dzãsi a lor: “Cai easti atsel, tsi ma s-lji cadã hiljilu icã boulu tu un puts, dzua di Sãmbãtã nu va l-scoatã trãoarã nafoarã?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ma elji nu puturã s-lji apãndisea. <verse eid="LUK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Isusul vidzu cã elji alãdzea locurili di nãinti la measã, sh-lã spusi unã parabolã a lor: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Cãndu ti acljeamã vãrã pi numtã, nu shedz tu protlu loc, cã vahi easti acljimat vãrã altu tsi easti ma tinjisit di tini, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />sh-atsel tsi vã ari acljimat di doilji voi, s-dzãcã: ‘Alas loclu a tãu aishtui.’ Sh-atumtsea tini arushinat, va ti duts s-shedz la loclu di ma nãpoi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Trã atsea cãndu ti acljeamã, duti shi shedz tu loclu dit soni, tsi cãndu s-yin atsel tsi ti ari acljimat, s-tsã dzãcã: ‘Oaspe, aproach-ti ma nsus.’ Atumtsea va s-hii tinjisit nãintea atsilor tsi suntu la measã cu tini. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Cã caitsido tsi va s-analtsã, va s-apleacã, sh-caitsido tsi va s-apleacã, va s-analtsã.” <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Isusul lj-dzãsi atsilui tsi lu avea acljimatã: “Cãndu fats un prãndzu icã unã tsinã, nu acljeamã oaspilji a tãlji, nitsi fratslji a tãlji, nitsi soia a ta, nitsi vitsinjlji atselji avutsi, cã sh-atselji va ti acljeamã tini, sh-ashã va s-tsã toarnã arãsplata. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Trã atsea, cãndu fats unã uspetsi acljeamã oarfãnjlji, sãcatsilji, shcljiochlji sh-orghilji. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Atumtsea, va s-hii ghinicuvintat cã elji nu au cum s-ts-u toarnã arãsplata, ma arãsplãtirea va tsã si da tu nyearea a ndreptsãlor.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Uspetsiljei atsiljei Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Un di atselji tsi eara acljimat la measã, dupã tsi li avdzã aesti, lj-dzãsi al Isus: “Ca hara di atsel tsi va s-mãcã tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Atumtsea Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Un om featsi unã uspetsi mari sh-acljimã multsã oaminji. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Cãndu vini oara a uspetslui, pitricu huzmichearlu a lui s-lã dzãtsea a acljimatslor: ‘Yinits, cã tuti suntu etinji tora.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Atumtsea tuts apãrnjirã s-caftã ljirtari. Protlu dzãsi: ‘Acumpãrai un agru sh-prindi s-mi duc s-lu ved. Tsã fac rigeai, s-mi ljertsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Un altu dzãsi: ‘Acumpãrai tsintsi pãreclji di boi sh-ma mi duc s-li bagã tu provã. Tsã fac rigeai, s-mi ljertsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Un altu dzãsi: ‘Macãt mi nsurai sh-trã atsea nu pot s-yin.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ashã huzmichearlu s-turnã sh-lji li aspusi tuti aesti a domnului a lui. Atumtsea nicuchirlu a casiljei, s-nãrãi sh-lji dzãsi a huzmichearlui a lui: ‘Trãoarã, duti prit cãljuri sh-tu sucãchili a cãsãbãlui sh-adu aoa oarfãnjlji, sãcatslji, orghilji shi shcljiochlji.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Deapoea huzmichearlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Doamne, s-featsi ashã cum ursish tini sh-nãpoi ari loc.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Atumtsea nicuchirlu lj-dzãsi a huzmichearlui: ‘Eshi prit sucãchii sh-prit garduri, sh-pindzi-lji oaminjlji s-intrã nãuntru si nji umplã casa. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Mini ma vã dzãc cã vãrã di atselji oaminji tsi eara acljimats, nu va-u gusteadzã uspetslu a meu.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S-Hii Uceniclu al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Multsãnji mãri urma Isusul, iarã elu s-turnã cãtrã elji sh-dzãsi: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Macã vãrã yini dupã mini sh-va ma multu di mini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zborlu gãrtseashti esti “aurashti”.</char></note> tatãl sh-muma a lui, muljearea sh-cilimenjlji, fratslji sh-surãrili a lui, ninga sh-bana a lui, nu poati s-hibã uceniclu a meu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Sh-cai nu u-tsãni crutsea a lui tra s-yinã dupã mini, nu poati s-hibã uceniclu a meu. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Cai di voi, macã va s-adarã unã culã, nu sheadi ma nãinti s-lugurseascã hãrgiuirili shi s-veadã macã ari pãradz trã ascãpari cula? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Altã soi, macã ari arcatã timeljilu sh-nu poati s-u ascapã, va l-pizueascã tuts atselji tsi va lu veadã, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />sh-va dzãcã: ‘Aestu om ahurhi s-adarã casã ma nu putu s-u ascapã.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Icã cai amirã, cãndu s-nchiseashti trã alumtari contra a unui altu amirã, nu s-apuni shi s-mindueashti ma nãinti, cã poati s-alumtã elu cu dzatsi njilji di suldats cu atsel tsi yini cu yinghits di njilji di suldats? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Atumtsea, macã nu poati, cãndu atselji altsãlji suntu diparti lji pitreatsi delegatsii tra si zburãscu trã pace. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ashãtsi, caitsido di voi tsi nu poati s-mutã mãna di atseali tsi ari, nu poati s-hibã uceniclu a meu. <verse eid="LUK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Sarea easti bunã, ma macã cheari njiurizma, cum poati s-u amintã nãpoi? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ea nu axizeashti nitsi tu loc nitsi tu cuprii, ma easti trã arcari. Cai ari ureclji trã avdzãri, s-avdã!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Oailjei Chirutã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Deapoea tuts taxidarlji sh-amãrtioshlji lji s-apruchea al Isus trã avdzãri. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Fariseilji shi scriblji murmurea: “Aestu aproachi amãrtioshlji sh-mãcã cu nãshi.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi aestã parabolã: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Cai di voi, tsi ari unã sutã di oi sh-cãndu unã di eali s-chearã, nu li alasã di noudzãtsinoauli tu irnjii shi s-dutsi dupã atsea tsi chiru, pãnã cãndu s-u aflã? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Sh-cãndu u-aflã, u ljea deanumirea cu harauã. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Cãndu yini acasã, acljeamã oaspilji sh-vitsinjlji a lui sh-lã dzãtsi: ‘Hãrsits-vã deadun cu mini, cã u aflai oaia tsi avea chirutã.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mini ma vã dzãc cã ashãtsi easti sh-tu tser. Aclo ari ma multã harauã trã un amãrtios tsi s-mitãnjiuseashti, dicãt trã noaudzãtsinoauã ndreptsã, tsi nu au ananghi s-mitãnjiuseascã.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Dhrahmiului Chirut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Icã, cai muljeari tsi ari dzatsi dhrahmadz sh-cheari un dhrahmiu, nu aprindi cãndila, nu areashti casa sh-deapoea caftã cu cãshtigã pãnã cãndu s-lu aflã? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Sh-cãndu lu aflã, acljeamã soatsili sh-vitsinili dzãcãnda: ‘Hãrsits-vã deadun cu mini, cã aflai dhrahmiulu tsi aveam chirutã.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Tutashã vã dzãc cã ashãtsi s-hãrseascã sh-anghilji a Dumnidzãlui trã un amãrtios tsi s-mitãnjiuseashti.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Hiljilui Chirut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Deapoea Isusul dzãsi: “Un om avea doi hilji. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ma tinirlu lj-dzãsi a tatãlui: ‘Tate, dã-nji partea a aveariljei tsi easti a mea.’ Sh-tatãl lã-u pãrtsã avearea. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Dupã niscãnti dzãli hiljilu atsel ma njiclu adunã tuti lucrili tsi avea shi s-dusi tu un loc diparti. Aclo hãrgiui tutã avearea, cã fãtsea unã banã disfãrnatã. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Dupã tsi asparsi tutã avearea, tu atsel loc vini un foami mari sh-elu apãrnji s-aibã ananghi. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Deapoea s-dusi sh-aflã lucru la un bãnãtor a atsilui loc. Elu l-pitricu tu agrili a lui s-pãshtea portslji. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Elu vrea s-hrãnea cu frutili a purnãrilor tsi mãca portslji, ma vãrã nu lji dãdea. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Atumtsea vini tu minti sh-dzãsi: ‘Multsã di lucrutorlji a tatãlui a meu au multã pãni trã mãcari, iarã mini mor di foami! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Va mi scol sh-va mi duc la tatã-njiu a meu sh-va lji dzãc: Tate, am amãrtisitã nãintea a tserlui sh-nãintea a ta. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Nu escu ma axiu s-mi acljem hiljiu a tãu. Mi tsãn ca un di huzmichearlji a tãlji.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ashãtsi si sculã shi s-dusi la tatã-su. Ma cãndu eara ninga diparti, tatã-su l-vidzu sh-sãmtsã dor. Trãoarã s-dusi la nãsu lu amvãrti cu bratsãli a lui sh-lu bãshe. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Atumtsea hilji-su lj-dzãsi: ‘Tate, am amãrtisitã nãintea a tserlui sh-nãintea a ta. Nu escu axiu s-mi acljem hiljiu a tãu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ma tatã-su lã dzãsi a huzmichearilor a lui: ‘Adutsets aoa stranjilu atsel ma bunlu sh-nvishtets-lu. Bãgats-lji nel tu dzeadit sh-sandali tu cicioari. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Loats yitsãlu atsel graslu sh-tãljeats-lu. S-mãcãm shi s-nã hãrsim, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />cã hiljiu a meu eara mortu shi s-turnã tu banã, eara chirut shi s-aflã.’ Sh-apãrnjirã s-hãrseascã.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Hiljilu a lui atsel ma marili eara tu agru. Cãndu s-apruche di casã, avdzã muzicã sh-giocuri. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Atumtsea acljimã un di sclayilji sh-lu ntribã cã tsi easti tut atsea. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Elu lj-apãndisi: ‘Fratili a tãu vini sh-tatãl a tãu tãlje yitsãlu atsel graslu, cã fratili a tãu s-turnã sãnãtos sh-ghini.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Atumtsea elu s-nãrãi sh-nu vrea s-intra. Ma tatã-su ishi afoarã sh-lji fãtsea rigeai s-intra. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Elu lj-apãndisi a tatã-sui: ‘Ia, mini am lucrat ca huzmichear ahãntsã anji trã tini sh-pute nu ts-am ncãlcatã vãrã ordin, sh-cu tut atsea tini nu nj-ai dat macari un ied tra s-mi hãrsescu cu sotslji a melji. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Iarã cãndu vini hiljiu a tãu, aestu tsi hãrgiui avearea a ta cu putãnji, tini tãljeashi trã nãsu yitsãlu atsel graslu!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Atumtsea tatã-su lj-dzãsi: ‘Hilje, tini eshti totãna cu mini, sh-itsido tsi am mini suntu a tali. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ma noi prindi s-nã hãrsim shi s-fãtsem chefi, cã fratili a tãu eara mortu shi s-turnã tu banã, eara chirut shi s-aflã.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Icunomlui Dishtiptat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Isusul lã-dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Un avut avea ca icunom a aveariljei a lui un om tsi fu cãtigursit ti hãrgiuirea a aveariljei a lui. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Atumtsea elu lu acljimã sh-lji dzãsi: ‘Tsi easti aestã tsi ma avdu trã tini? Da-nji lugurii trã lucrul a tãu cã tini nu pots s-hii ma icunom.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Icunomlu dzãsi cu mintea a lui: ‘Nicuchirlu a meu va u ljea icunumia di la mini. Tsi s-fac? Si sap nu pot, s-mi fac dicunjar nj-yini arushini. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mini shtiu tsi va s-fac tsi oaminjlji s-mi aproachi tu cãsili a lor, cãndu va mi scoatã ca icunom.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Ashãtsi lã acljimã un cãti un atselji tsi lji avea mprumut a nicuchirlui a lui sh-lji dzãsi a protlui: ‘Cãt lji hãrzãeshti a nicuchirlui a meu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Elu lj-apãndisi: ‘Unã sutã di misuri di untulemu.’ Icunomlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Ljea muluyia a ta, apunã-ti sh-trãoarã scrii tsindzãtsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Deapoea ntribã un altu: ‘Ma tini cãt lj-ai mprumut?’ Elu lj-apãndãsi: ‘Unã sutã di misuri di grãn.’ Atumtsea icunomlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Ljea muluyia a ta shi scrii optudzãtsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Nicuchirlu alãvdã icunomlu atsel nindreptu, cã avea lucratã cu mintimenilji. Hiljilji a etiljei aishtei suntu ma mintimenji di hiljilji a lunjinãljei cu unu-alantu. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Trã atsea mini ma vã dzãc: Fãtsets oaspi cu averili a locului, cã cãndu s-ascapã avearea, s-vã aproachi tu cãsili di daima. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Cai easti pistimen tu njitsi, easti pistimen sh-tu mãri, sh-cai easti nindreptu tu njitsi, easti nindreptu sh-tu mãri. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Macã nu avets fut pistimenji tu averili atseali nindrepti, cai va s-vã pistipseascã tu averili di-alihea? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Sh-macã nu avets fut pistimenji tu averili a unui altu, cai va s-vã da avearea a voastra? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Vãrã huzmichear nu poati s-huzmitipseascã la doi nicuchiri. Elu, icã va aurascã unlu sh-alantu va lu va, icã va si s-leagã cu unlu sh-alantu va lu dispretsueascã. Nu putets s-huzmitipsits sh-a Dumnidzãlui sh-a pãrãlui.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Autoritatea a Legiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Fariseilji tsi eara tãmãchear di pãradzi avdza itsido sh-arãdea cu Isusul. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi: “Voi hits atselji tsi nãintea a oaminjlor vã aspunets ndreptsã, ma Dumnidzãlu li cunoashti ininjli a voastri, cã atsea tsi easti anãltsat la oaminjlji easti urutã nãintea al Dumnidzãu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Legea sh-scriturili a prufitsilor agiumsirã pãnã tu chirolu al Ioan. Deapoea s-dimãndã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui sh-tuts s-cilistiseascã s-intrã aclo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Cu tut atsea, ma lishor easti s-chearã loclu sh-tserlu, dicãt s-chearã macari un punctu di lege. <verse eid="LUK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Caitsido tsi alasã muljearea a lui shi ljea unã altã, ncalcã curunea. Atsel tsi si nsoari cu unã muljeari alãsatã di bãrbatlu, ncalcã curunea.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Avutlu sh-Lazarul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Eara un om avut, tsi s-nvishtea cu stranji di purpurã sh-suptsãri scumpi sh-cathi dzuã fãtsea chefi pri uspetsuri. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />La usha a lui shidea un oarfãn, acljimat Lazar, tsi truplu lu avea mplinã di pledzi, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />sh-vrea s-fãnãtea cu sãrmili tsi cãdea di measa a avutlui. Sh-cãnjilji yinea sh-alindzea pledzili. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Oarfãnlu muri sh-anghilji lu dusirã ningã di Abraham. Muri sh-avutlu sh-lu ngruparã. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Tu Colasi iu ma trãdzea munduirili, sculã ocljilji sh-vidzu di diparti Abrahamul cu Lazarul ningã nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Atumtsea elu grãi cu boatsi analtã sh-dzãsi: ‘Tate Abraham, s-tsã hibã njilã di mini, sh-pitreatsi Lazarul s-moalji dzeaditlu a lui tu apã shi s-nji audã limba, cã ma mi munduescu multu tu aestu foc.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ma Abrahamul lj-dzãsi: ‘Hilje, adu a minti cã tini li loash bunili a tali tu bana a ta, iarã Lazarul atseali aralili. Tora elu s-hãrseashti sh-tini ti mundueshti. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Sh-pristi tuti, namisa di noi sh-di voi easti unã ahãndami mari, tsi atselji tsi vor s-treacã di aoa cãtrã voi nu poatã. Tutashã vãrã nu poati s-treacã di aclo cãtrã noi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Avutlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Atumtsea, tate, tsã fac rigeai s-lu pitretsi la casa a tatãlui a meu. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Am tsintsi frats shi s-lã dimãndã tra s-nu yinu sh-elji aoa tu aestu loc trã munduiri.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abrahamul lj-apãndisi: ‘Elji au Moisiul sh-Prufitsilji, prindi s-ascultã atselji.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Elu dzãsi: ‘Nu, tate Abraham, ma macã va s-ducã vãrã di mortsãlji la nãshi, elji va s-mitãnjiuseascã.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Atumtsea Abrahamul lj-dzãsi: ‘Macã nu ascultã Moisiul sh-Prufitsilji, atumtsea nu va s-cãndãrseascã sh-macã vãrã om si nyeadzã dit mortsã.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Amãrtia, Pistea sh-Huzmitipsirea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Nu poati s-nu s-yinã cheditsi, ma cavai di atsel tsi s-fatsi sibepi s-yin! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Trã nãsu va eara ma ghini si spindzura di gushi unã cheatrã di moarã shi si s-arca tu amari, dicãt si s-fac sibepi tra s-cad tu amãrtii un di atselji njitslji. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />S-avets cãshtiga! Macã fratili icã sora a ta amãrtiseashti contra tini, vãrghea-lji, sh-macã s-mitãnjiuseascã, ljeartã-lji. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Macã amãrtiseashti contra tini shapti ori tu dzuã, shi shapti ori yini sh-tsã dzãtsi: ‘Mi-mitãnjiusescu,’ ljeartã-lu.” <verse eid="LUK 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Atumtsea apostulji lj-dzãsirã a Domnului: “Mãrea-nã pistea!” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Sh-Domnul dzãsi: “Ma s-aveat pisti cãt un gãrnuts di sinapi, va s-lji dzãtseat aishtui ciriciu: ‘Scoatã-ti cu arãdãtsinã sh-seaminã-ti tu amari,’ sh-ciriciu va s-vã asculta. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Cai di voi, ma s-aibã un huzmichear tsi lji lucreadzã agrul icã lj-pashti oili, va lji dzãc cãndu elu s-turna dit cãmpu: ‘Ursea trãoarã la measã’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Nu va lj-dzãcã: ‘Ndreadzi-nji tsina, scoalã mãnitsli sh-huzmitipsea-nji s-mãc shi s-beau, sh-deapoea s-mãts shi s-beai sh-tini’? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Va lji dzãcã haristo a huzmichearlui cã featsi atseali tsi lji li dimãndã? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ashãtsi sh-voi, cãndu s-li fãtsets tuti atseali tsi vã suntu dimãndati, dzãtsets: ‘Him huzmicheari fãrã hãiri. Noi avem faptã atsea tsi prindi s-fãtsem.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Vindicã Dzatsi Leproshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Cãndu ma njidzea cãtrã Ierusalem, Isusul tricu namisa di Samaria sh-di Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Cãndu ma intra tu unã hoarã, lj-ishirã nãinti dzatsi leproshi. Elji stãturã diparti. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Anãltsãndã boatsea dzãsirã: “Isuse, Nvitsãtore, s-ai njilã trã noi!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Elu lji vidzu sh-lã dzãsi: “Dutsets-vã sh-aspunets-vã la preftsãlji.” Sh-undzi tsi cãndu ma njidzea, s-curarã. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Deapoea un di atselji, anda vidzu cã s-vindicã, s-turnã sh-alãvda Dumnidzãlu cu boatsi analtã. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Elu cãdzu pri dintsi la cicioarili al Isus sh-lu hãristisea. Elu eara Samaritan. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Isusul atumtsea lu ntribã: “Nu s-vindicarã di dzatsilji? Iu suntu atselji noaulji? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nu s-aflã nitsiunu di nãshi tsi si s-turna shi s-lji dãdea alãvdari a Dumnidzãlui, dicãt mash aestu xenlu?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Deapoea lj-dzãsi a lui: “Scoalã-ti sh-imnã! Pistea a ta ti vindicã.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vinita a Amirãriljei al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Cãndu Fariseilji lu ntribarã Isusul cã cãndu va yinã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui, elu lã apãndisi a lor: “Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui nu va yinã tra s-hibã vidzut, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Nu va s-poat s-dzãcã: ‘Ia, easti aoa,’ icã: ‘Ia, easti aclo!’ Cã Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui easti nãuntru tu voi.” <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor: “Va yinã dzãlili cãndu voi va vrets s-videts unã di dzãlili a Hiljilui a Omlui, sh-nu va u-videts. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Atumtsea va vã dzãcã: ‘Ia, aoa!’ Icã: ‘Ia, aclo!’ Ma nu vã dutsets sh-nu u-urmats. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Cã, ashã ca sfulgul tsi ascapirã sh-lunjineadzã tserlu dit un mardzini a lui tu alantã mardzini, ashã va hibã sh-Hiljilu a Omlui tu dzua a lui. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ma, ma nãinti elu prindi si s-mundueascã multu shi si s-aleapid di aestã farã. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Sh-ashã cum undzi tu dzua al Noe, ashã va hibã sh-tu dzua a Hiljilui a Omlui. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Tu atsel chiro oaminjlji mãca, bea, si nsura, s-mãrta pãnã tu dzua cãndu Noe intrã tu varcã. Deapoea vini nãcarea sh-lji chiru di tuts. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ashãtsi undzi sh-tu dzãlili al Lot. Oaminjlji mãca, bea, acumpãra, vindea, simina sh-adra cãsi. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Iarã tu dzua tsi Lotul ishi dit Sodom, cãdzu foc sh-schifurã dit tser sh-lji chiru tuts. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ashãtsi va hibã sh-tu atsea dzuã cãndu va si aspunã Hiljilu a Omlui. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Tu atsea dzuã, vãrã tsi va hibã pri citia a casiljei sh-lucrili a lui va hibã n-casã, s-nu dipunã s-li ljea atseali. Tutashã, atsel tsi easti tu cãmpuri s-nu s-toarnã nãpoi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Adutsets-vã a minti di muljearea al Lot!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Ahr 19:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Caitsido tsi va u ascapã bana a lui, va u-chearã, sh-caitsido tsi va u-chearã, va u-ascapã. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Mini ma vã dzãc: tu atsea noapti doi oaminji va hibã tu un pat, un va si s-ljea sh-alantu va si s-alasã. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Doauã muljeri va hibã trã mãtsinari deadun, unã va si s-ljea sh-alanta va si s-alasã. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Doi bãrbats va hibã tu cãmpu; un va si s-ljea sh-alantu va si s-alasã.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu versu nu s-aflã tu manuscrisili atseali veaclji</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji l-ntribarã: “Iu, Doamne?” Sh-elu lã dzãsi: “Iu easti cufuma, aclo s-adunã shi vulturilji.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Giudicãtorlui Nindreptu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor unã parabolã, tra s-lã aspunã cã cum prindi s-nã rugãm dipriunã fãrã s-chearã nãdia. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Elu dzãsi: “Tu un cãsãbã eara un giudicãtor tsi nu avea fricã di Dumnidzãlu sh-nu avea rispect di vãrã om. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Tu atsel cãsãbã eara sh-unã veduvã tsi njidzea la nãsu sh-lji fãtsea rigeai: ‘Dã-nji ndriptati nãintea a contrarlui a meu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ti putsãn chiro elu nu vru s-u fãtsea, ma deapoea dzãsi: ‘Cu tutã cã nu am fricã di Dumnidzãlu sh-nu am rispect di vãrã om, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />metsi aestã veduvã ma mi cãrteashti, va lji dau ndriptati, tra s-nu yinã dipriunã s-mi creapã.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Sh-Domnul dzãsi: “Avdzãts tsi dzãtsi giudicãtorlu atsel nindreptu. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Vahi Dumnidzãlu nu va lj-da ndriptati a aleptsilor a lui tsi lj-grescu dzuã sh-noapti? Va amãnã vahi s-apofãseascã ti agiutarea a lor? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mini ma vã dzãc cã elu va s-apofãseascã trãoarã ti ndriptati. Ma cãndu va yinã Hiljilu a Omlui, va aflã pisti pri loc?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola trã Fariseul sh-trã Taxidarlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Isusul lã dzãsi unã altã parabolã trã niscãntsã tsi minduia cã eara ndreptsã sh-dispretsuea altsãlji: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Doi oaminji s-alinarã tu templu s-ruga, un eara Fariseu sh-alantu taxidar. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Fariseul stãtea pi cicioari shi s-ruga ashãtsi cu mintea a lui: ‘Dumnidzale, ti hãristisescu tsi nu escu ca altsã oaminji arãchitori, nindreptsã, curun-cãlcatã, sh-nitsi ca aestu taxidar. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mini tsãnu pãreasinji doauã ori tu stãmãnã sh-plãtescu a dzatsea parti trã itsido tsi amintã.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Iarã taxidarlu tsi stãtea diparti sh-nu cutidza si scula nitsi ocljilji cãtrã tser, bãtea cheptul a lui dzãcãnda: ‘Dumnidzale, s-ai njilã trã mini amãrtioslu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Mini ma vã dzãc cã aestu om, sh-nu Fariseu s-turnã la casã ndriptat nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. Cã caitsido tsi s-analtsã, va s-apunã, sh-cai va s-apunã va s-analtsã.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cilimenjlji Atselji Njitsi sh-Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Niscãntsã oaminji adutsea cilimenji la Isusul tsi s-bãga mãna pri nãshi, ma ucenitsilji cãndu vidzurã aestã lji vãrghirã. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ma Isusul lji acljimã cilimenjlji ningã nãsu sh-lã dzãsi: “Alãsats cilimenjlji atselji njitsi s-yinã la mini sh-nu lji nchidicats, cã a lor easti amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã atsel tsi nu u-aproachi amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui ca un cilimean njic, nu va s-intrã tu atsea.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Avutul sh-Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Un di mãrlji a Iudeilor lu ntribã: “Bun nvitsãtore, tsi prindi s-fac tsi s-mushtinedz bana eternã?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Sh-Isusul dzãsi: “Cãtse nji dzãts bun? Vãrã nu easti bun, dicãt un singur, Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Tini li cunoshti dimãndãrili: ‘Nu ncalcã curuna, nu vatãmã, nu fur, nu dã mãrtirii arãdioasã, tinjisea tatãl a tãu sh-muma a ta.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Atumtsea atsel bãrbat dzãsi: “Tuti aesti li-am faptã di-tu tinireatsa a mea.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Cum avdzã aestã, Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Ts-lipseashti ninga un lucru. Vindi tuti cãti ai sh-dã-li a oarfãnjilor sh-va s-ai ayishteari tu tser. Deapoea, haidi sh-urmeadzã-mi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ma cãndu li avdzã aesti elu, s-nvirinã multu, cã eara multu avut. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Atumtsea Isusul, cãndu lu vidzu, dzãsi: “Cãt greu easti trã atselji tsi au aveari s-intrã tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Easti ma lishor s-treacã unã cãmilã prit guva a aclui, dicãt s-intrã avutlu tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Sh-atselji tsi ma avdza lu ntribarã: “Ma cai poati s-ascapã?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Isusul apãndisi: “Atsea tsi easti nipututã trã oaminjlji, easti putut trã Dumnidzãlu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Deapoea Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Ia, noi avem alãsat itsido sh-ti urmãm.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi a-lor: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã nu easti vãrã tsi ari alãsatã casa, muljearea, frats, surãri, pãrintsã, sh-cilimenji trã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />tsi s-nu ljea multu ma multu tu aestu chiro sh-tu chirolu tsi va yinã s-ljea bana eternã.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Prispuni di a Treia Oarã Moartea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Deapoea Isusul lo dinãparti di doisprãdzatslji sh-lã dzãsi: “Ia, noi ma nã alinãm la Ierusalem sh-tuti atseali tsi scriarã prufitsilji trã Hiljilu a Omlui va si mplineascã. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Elu va s-prida a pãngãnjilor sh-va lu-pizueascã, va s-tirãnseascã sh-va hibã ascucheat. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Deapoea va lu zãpãleascã, va lu vatãmã, ma tu dzua a treia va s-nyeadzã.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ucenitsilji nu aduchirã tsiva di aesti cã eara ascumtu sh-elji nu aduchea atseali tsi elu avea dzãsã.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Un Orbu Dicunjar Amintã Videarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Iarã Isusul ma s-apruchea di Ierico, sh-un orbu shidea ningã cali cu mãna teas. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Cãndu avdzã cã ma tritsea unã multsãmi, ntribã cã tsi eara. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Elji lj-apãndisirã cã ma treatsi Isus Nazareanlu. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Atumtsea orbul aurlã dzãcãnda: “Isus, Hiljilu al David, s-ai njilã ti mini!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Atselji tsi imna nãinti lu vãrghirã s-tãtsea, ma elu aurlã sh-ma multu: “Hiljilu al David, s-ai njilã ti mini!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Atumtsea Isusul dãnãsi sh-ursi s-lj-adutsea orbulu. Cãndu elu s-apruche, Isusul lu ntribã: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Tsi vrei s-fac ti tini?” Sh-elu apãndisi: “Doamne, s-ved nãpoi!” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Sh-Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Vedz nãpoi! Pistea a ta ti vindicã.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Tu atsea oarã lji si turnã videarea nãpoi sh-urmãnda Isusul multumãrea Dumnidzãlu, sh-tut populu, cãndu vidzu aestã, alãvda Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Zacheu Taxidarlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Isusul intrã tu Ierico sh-ma tritsea prit cãsãbã. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Aclo eara un om cu numa Zache. Elu eara ma marli a taxidarilor sh-eara avut. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Elu cãfta s-videa cai eara Isusul, ma nu putea trã itia a multsãmiljei, cã elu eara shcurtu di trup. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Atumtsea aĝunjisinda nãinti, s-alinã pri un hic tra s-lu videa, cã Isusul ma tritsea pri aclo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Cãndu Isusul agiumsi aclo, sculã ocljilji, lu vidzu sh-lji dzãsi: “Zache, dipunã-ti trãoarã nghios, cã azã prindi s-shed la casa a ta.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Elu dipunã trãoarã sh-lu ashtiptã cu harauã. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Cãndu lu vidzurã aestã, tuts apãrnjirã ti murmurari, dzãcãnda: “Isusul intrã s-sheadã tu casa a unui om amãrtios.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Atumtsea Zacheu si sculã sh-lji dzãsi a Domnului: “Ia, Doamne, mini ma dau a oarfãnjilor giumitatea a aveariljei a mea, sh-macã lji am loat a vãrui tsiva cu nindreptu, va lji-u tornu di-patru ori ma multu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Atumtsea Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Azã vini ascãparea tu aestã casã, cã sh-aestu easti hiljilu al Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Cã Hiljilu a Omlui vini s-caftã shi s-ascapã atsel tsi avea chirut.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola atsilor Dzatsi Mine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Cãndu elji ma asculta aesti, Isusul lã dzãsi unã parabolã, metsi eara aproapi di Ierusalem sh-elji minduea cã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui va s-fãnirusea trãoarã. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Un om nobil s-dusi tu un loc diparti tra s-ljea ntru mãnã un amirãrilji sh-deapoea s-turna. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Acljimã dzatsi di huzmichearlji a lui, lã deadi dzatsi mine sh-lã dzãsi: ‘Ufilisits aesti pãradzi pãnã cãndu s-mi tornu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ma oaminjlji a cãsabãlui lu aura sh-lji-pitricurã un delegatsion s-lji dzãtsea: ‘Nu vrem tsi aestu s-domneascã pristi noi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Cãndu elu s-turnã lo stãpuirea a amirãriljei sh-ursi s-acljima huzmichearlji, tsi avea datã pãradzlji tra s-veadã cãt avea amintatã cathiun. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Atumtsea vini protlu sh-lji dzãsi: ‘Doamne, mina a ta deadi dzatsi mine.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Elu lj-dzãsi: ‘Ghini, huzmichear bun. Metsi earai pistimen tu lucri njitsi, ljea domnirea pristi dzatsi cãsãbadz.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Deapoea vini a doilu sh-lji dzãsi: ‘Doamne, mina a ta deadi tsintsi mine.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Elu lj-dzãsi: ‘Sh-tini va s-ai domnilji pristi tsintsi cãsãbadz.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Deapoea vini alantu sh-lji dzãsi: ‘Doamne, ia, iu easti mina a ta. Mini u tsãnui amvãrtit cu unã pitsetã, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />cã aveam fricã di tini, cã eshti om aspru. Tini ljeai atsea tsi nu u ai bãgatã, sh-seatsiri atsea tsi nu u ai siminatã.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Nicuchirlu lj-dzãsi: ‘Huzmichear arãu! Di zboarili a tali va ti giudic. Tini shtiai cã earam om aspru, tsi ljeau atsea tsi nu am bãgatã, sh-seatsir atsea tsi nu am siminatã? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Cãtse nu li bãgash pãradzlji la bancã, tsi cãndu s-yineam, s-lji loam cu interes?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Deapoea lã dzãsi atsilor tsi eara aclo: ‘Loats-u mina sh-dats-lji-u atsilui tsi ari dzatsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Elji lj-dzãsirã: ‘Doamne, ma elu ari dzatsi mine!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Elu lã apãndisi: ‘Mini ma vã dzãc cã a cuitsido tsi ari, va lji si da ma multu, ma atsilui tsi nu ari, va lji si ljea sh-atsea tsi ari. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Iarã neamitsilji a melji, tsi nu vrurã tsi mini s-mi fãtseam amirãlu a lor, adutsets-lji aoa sh-vãtãmats-lji nãintea a mea!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Yini tu Ierusalem ca Amirã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Dupã tsi dzãsi aesti, Isusul s-nchisi nãintea a multsãmiljei cãtrã Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Cãndu s-apruche di Betafaghe sh-di Betania, ningã muntili numit a Masnjilor, pitricu doi di ucenitsilji a lui, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />dzãcãnda: “Dutsets-vã tu hoara di-agnanghea sh-cãndu s-intrats, va aflats aclo un gumãric ligat, pri cai nitsiunu nu s-ari ncãlicat. Dizligats-lu sh-adutsets-lu aoa. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Macã vãrã va vã ntreabã: ‘Cãtse lu dizligats?’ apãndisits-lji: ‘Domnul ari ananghi di nãsu.’” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Atumtsea pitricutslji s-dusirã sh-lu aflarã ashã cum lã avea dzãsã Isusul. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Cãndu ma lu dizliga gumãriclu, nicuchirlji lji ntribarã: “Cãtse ma lu dizligats gumãriclu?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Elji apãndisirã: “Domnul ari ananghi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Atumtsea lu dusirã gumãriclu la Isusul sh-dupã tsi lj-arcarã prisupru a gumãriclui stranjili a lor, ncãlicarã pri nãsu Isusul. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Pri tutã calea oaminjlji ashtirnea stranjili a lor nãintea a lui. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Cãndu elu s-apruche tu calea tsi dipuni dit Muntili a Masnjilor, tutã multsãmea a ucenitsilor ahurhi s-alãvda Dumnidzãlu cu harauã sh-cu boatsi analtã trã tuti thavmatili puternici tsi avea vidzutã. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Elji dzãtsea: “Ghinicuvintat s-hibã amirãlu tsi yini tu numa a Domnului! Pace tu tser, sh-mãriri tu locurili atseli analti!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ps 118:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Niscãntsã Farisei dit multsãmea lj-dzãsirã al Isus: “Nvitsãtore, vãrghea ucenitsilji a tãlji!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Elu lã apãndisi: “Mini ma vã dzãc cã, macã aeshti va tãtsea, va aurla chetrili.” <verse eid="LUK 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Cãndu s-apruche di cãsãbã sh-lu vidzu, Isusul plãmsi trã nãsu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />dzãcãnda: “Canda s-aveai cunuscut sh-tini tu aestã dzuã atseali tsi aducã pacea a ta! Ma tora atseali suntu ascumti trã ocljilji a tãlji. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ma yinã dzãlili cãndu dushmanjlji a tãlji va s-adar prohumã anvãrliga di tini sh-va ti stringã di tuti pãrtsãli. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Deapoea va ti ashtearnã mpadi tini sh-oaminjlji a tãlji nãuntru di murilji a tãlji. Nu va alasã cheatrã pristi cheatrã, cã tini nu ai cunuscutã chirolu cãndu Dumnidzãlu ti ari vizitat.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul tu Templu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Deapoea Isusul intrã tu templu, sh-ahurhi si aĝuneascã atselji tsi vindea aclo, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />dzãcãnda: “Easti scriatã: ‘Casa a mea easti casã di rugãciunji,’ ma voi u-featsit ‘pishtireauã trã furlji.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Ier 7:11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Isusul lã nvitsa oaminjlji cathi dzuã tu templu. Arhipreftsãlji, scriblji sh-mãrlji a popului cãfta s-lu vãtãma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ma nu shtia tsi s-adra, cã tut populu li asculta cu harauã zboarili a lui.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Autoritatea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Unã dzuã, iarã Isusul ma nvitsa populu a lui tu templu sh-lã predica a tutulor evanghelu, vinirã mãrlji a preftsãlor shi scriblji deadun cu aushlji, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />sh-lji dzãsirã: “Dzã-nã cu tsi autoritati li fats aesti? Cai easti atsel tsi ts-u deadi aestã autoritati?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Sh-elu apãndisi: “Sh-mini am unã ntribari ti voi. Apãndisits-nji: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Pitedzlu al Ioan eara dit tser ama di la oaminjlji?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Elji s-minduea namisa di nãshi dzãcãnda: “Ma s-dzãtsem: ‘Dit tser,’ elu va nã dzãcã: ‘Atumtsea cãtse nu lu pistipsit?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ma s-lji dzãtsem: ‘Di la oaminjlji,’ tut populu va nã vatãmã cu chetri, cã easti cãndãrsit cã Ioanul eara un prufit.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Trã atsea lji apãndisirã cã nu shtia di iu yinea. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Nitsi mini nu ma vã dzãc cã cu tsi autoritati li fac aesti.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Ayinjearilor Atselji Arãi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Deapoea apãrnji s-lã aspun a popului aestã parabolã: “Un om siminã unã ayinji, u deadi la niscãntsã ayinjeari cu nichi sh-fudzi diparti di multu chiro.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Tu chirolu a ayizmãrilor, pitricu un huzmichear la ayinjearlji tsi s-lji dãdea partea a lui di birichetea a ayinjiljei, ma ayinjearlji l-bãturã sh-lu turnarã cu mãnjili goali. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Elu pitricu nãpoi un altu huzmichear, ma elji, dupã tsi lu bãturã sh-lu ngiurarã sh-atsel, lu turnarã cu mãnjili goali. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Deapoea pitricu sh-al treilu, ma elji lu pliguirã sh-lu aĝiunirã sh-atsel. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Atumtsea nicuchirlu a ayinjiljei dzãsi: ‘Tsi prindi s-fac? Va pitrec ficiorlu a meu vrut. Vahi, vidzãnda atsel, va lu respecteadzã!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ma ayinjearlji, cãndu lu vidzurã, dzãsirã un cu-alantu: ‘Aestu easti mushtinitorlu. Haidets s-lu vãtãmãm sh-mushtinirea si nã armãnã a noauã.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ashãtsi lu scoasirã nafoarã di ayinji sh-lu vãtãmarã. Tsi va lã facã aishtor nicuchirlu a ayinjãljei? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Elu va yinã, va s-lji vatãmã ayinjearlji sh-va u da ayinjea la altsã.” Ma oaminjlji cãndu li avdzãrã aesti dzãsirã: “Dumnidzã s-nã afireascã!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Atumtsea Isusul vidzãnda cãtrã nãshi dzãsi: “Tsi vrea s-dzãcã atsea tsi easti scriatã: ‘Cheatra tsi masturlji u arcarã, s-featsi cheatra a chioshljei?’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ps 118:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Caitsido tsi va s-cadã pri aestã cheatrã va si s-facã bucãtsi sh-atsilui tsi va lj-cadã va si s-dãrãmã.” <verse eid="LUK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Tu atsea oarã mãrlji a preftsãlor shi scriblji cãfta s-bãga mãna pri nãsu, cã avea aduchitã cã elu u avea spusã atsea parabolã trã elji, ma avea fricã di lumea.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Plãtirea a Taxilor al Cezar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Elji lu vigljea sh-lji pitricurã niscãntsã spiunji cai s-prifãtsea ca oaminji ndreptsã s-lu acãtsa tu cãbati cu vãrã zbor sh-deapoea s-lj-u dãdea la putearea sh-la autoritatea a guvernatorlui. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Aeshti lu ntribarã: “Nvitsãtore, noi shtim cã tini zburashti sh-nvets ndreptu sh-nu tsãnji cu hãtãri, ma nvets la alantsã cala a Dumnidzãlui dupã alihea. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Prindi noi s-plãtim taxa a Cezarlui, ama nu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ma Isusul, cunuscãnda ileea a lor, lã dzãsi: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Spunets-nji un denar. A cui easti fatsa shi scritura tsi ari pri nãsu?” Sh-elji apãndisirã: “A Cezarlui.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Dats-lã a Cezarlui atseali tsi suntu a Cezarlui, sh-a Dumnidzãlui atsea tsi easti a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ashãtsi elji nu puturã s-lu acatsã tu cãbati tu zborlu a lui nãintea a popului sh-ciudisits di apandisea a lui tãcurã.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyearea sh-Mãrtarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Deapoea lji s-apruchearã niscãntsã di Saduceilji, tsi aleapid cã ari nyeari sh-lu ntribarã, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />dzãcãnda: “Nvitsãtore, Moisiul nã alãsã scriatã cã, macã fratili a vãrui moari sh-muljearea a lui nu alasã cilimenji, fratili a lui s-u ljea muljearea a frat-sui shi s-facã cilimenji di frat-su. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Eara shapti frats, protlu si nsurã sh-muri ni alãsat cilimenji. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />A doilu u lo di muljeari sh-elu muri ni alãsat cilimenji. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />U lo deapoea a treilu, sh-ashãtsi di shaptilji murirã ni alãsat cilimenji. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Dupã nãshi muri sh-muljearea. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Atumtsea tu nyeari, a cui va hibã muljearea? Cã di shapti u avurã muljeari.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Isusul lã apãndisi a lor: “Oaminjlji a etiljei aishtei si nsoarã shi s-mãritã. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ma atselji tsi va hibã axii trã alantã etã sh-tu nyearea a mortsãlor, nu si nsoarã sh-nu va s-mãritã. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Elji nitsi nu potã s-moarã ma, cã suntu ca anghilji shi suntu hiljilji a Dumnidzãlui, metsi elji suntu nyeat dit mortsã. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ma sh-Moisiul ari aspusã la ruglu tsi ma s-ardea, cã mortsãlji s-nyeadzã, cãndu Moisiul lu numeashti Domnu ‘Dumnidzãlu al Abraham, Dumnidzãlu al Isac sh-Dumnidzãlu al Iacov.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Domnul nu easti Dumnidzãlu a mortsãlor, ma a yiilor, cã tuts bãneadzã trã nãsu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Atumtsea niscãntsã scribii loarã zborlu sh-dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore, ghini zburashi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Shi nu cutidzarã s-lji facã altã ntribari.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiljilu a Cui Easti Mesia?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Deapoea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Vahi, cum dzãc cã Hristolu easti Hiljilu al David? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Idyiul David, tu Cartea a Psalnjilor dzãtsi: ‘Domnul lj-dzãsi a Domnului a meu: “Shedz di-nandreapta a mea, <verse eid="LUK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />pãnã-cãndu s-lji bagã dushmanjlji a tãlji ca scamnu la cicioarili a tali.”’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ps 110:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Davidul, lu acljeami ‘Domnu,’ cum poati s-hibã hiljilu a lui?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urnipsiri Contra a Nvitsãtorilor di Lege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Cãndu tut populu ma asculta, Isusul lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Afirits-vã di scriblji, tsi lã arãsescu si s-primnã cu stranji lundzi, sh-vor ncljinãciunji prit pãdzi, s-hibã tu protili locuri tu sinagogã sh-tu protili locuri prit uspetsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Elji mãcã cãsili a veduvilor sh-tra si s-veadã, facã rugãciunji lundzi. Elji va s-ljea un giudicari ma greu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Oferta a Veduvãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Deapoea Isusul sculã ocljilji sh-vidzu avutslji cai aruca pischesili a lor tu cutia a ayishteariljei tu templu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Elu vidzu sh-unã veduvã niavutã tsi bãgã nãuntru doi pãradz njitsi, <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />sh-dzãsi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã aestã veduvã niavutã ari bãgatã ma multu dicãt tuts alantsãlji. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Cã tuts aeshti deadirã di artirizma a ayishteariljei a lor. Iarã ea, cu niavearea a ljei, deadi itsi avea ti bãnari.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aspãrdzearea a Templui sh-Seamnili a Chirolui dit Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Deapoea niscãntsã ma zbura ti templu sh-dzãtsea cã easti stulsit cu chetri mushati sh-cu pischesi sãmtsãti a Dumnidzãlui. Ma Isusul dzãsi: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Di tuti aesti tsi voi videts, va yinã dzãlili, cãndu nu va armãnã cheatrã pristi cheatrã sh-tuti va s-arucã mpadi.” <verse eid="LUK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Atumtsea elji lu ntribarã: “Nvitsãtore, cãndu va s-facã aesti sh-cai va s-hibã semnul cã aesti va s-facã?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Sh-elu dzãsi: “Afirits-vã si nu vã arãdã, cã multsã oaminji va yinã tu numa a mea dzãcãnda: ‘Mini escu elu,’ shi: ‘Vini chirolu,’ ma nu dutsets-vã dupã nãshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Cãndu s-avdzãts si zburãscu di alumti sh-di mintituri, nu vã fricuits, cã tuti aesti prindi si s-facã ma nãinti, ma bitisita nu va yinã trãoarã.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Apoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Va si scoalã natsiunea contra a natsiuniljei, sh-amirãriljea contra a amirãriljei. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Va si s-facã cutremburi mãri, urfanji di pãni sh-hulerã tu multi locuri, fãnirusiri fricoasi sh-seamni mãri va si s-veadã tu tser. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ma, nãinti di tuti aesti, va s-bagã mãna pri voi sh-va s-vã avinã. Va s-vã prida tu sinagogã va s-vã bagã tu hapsi sh-va s-vã ducã nãintea a amiradzlor sh-a guvernatorilor trã itia a numãljei a mea. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Aestu va hibã chirolu tsi s-mãrtirsits. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Bãgats-lã tu ininjli a voastri tsi s-nu minduits ma nãinti cum s-vã apãndisits tra s-vã afirits, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />cã mini va vã dau gura sh-mintimeniljea tsi tuts neamitsilji a voshtri nu va s-poatã s-vã s-aravdã icã s-vã ncuntreadzã. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Sh-voi va vã prida pãrintsãlji, fratslji, surãrili, soia sh-uspitsãljea sh-niscãntsã di voi va si s-vatãmã. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Tuts va s-vã aurascã trã itia a numãljei a mea. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ma nitsi un hir di per a caplui a vostru nu va vã chearã. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Cu arãvdarea a voastrã voi va amintats suflitli a voastri.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munduirea Atsea Marea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Cãndu s-videts Ierusalemlu anvãrligat di armatili, si shtits cã shcretuirea a ljei easti aproapi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Atumtsea atselji tsi suntu tu Iudea, s-fugã tu muntsã. Atselji tsi suntu tu cãsãbã, s-dipãrteadzã, sh-atselji tsi suntu pri cãmpuri, s-nu intrã tu cãsãbã. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Cã aesti suntu dzãli di arãzgãnarea a Dumnidzãlui, tsi s-mplineascã tuti atseali tsi suntu scriati. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Mãrati di muljerili atseli greali sh-atseali tsi va s-ntricã njitslji tu atseali dzãli, cã va s-aibã munduiri mari loclu sh-nãriri pristi aestu popul. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Elji va s-cadã di lipida a spatãljei, va si s-ljea ca sclayi di tuti fãrili, sh-Ierusalemlu va lu ncalcã pãngãnjlji, pãnã-cãndu si mplineascã chirolu a pãngãnjilor.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Turnarea a Hiljilui a Omlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Va s-aibã seamni tu soari, tu lunã sh-tu steali. Pri loc va s-hibã frica a popului di vãzirea a amariljei sh-a vãljiurilor. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Oaminjlji va s-moarã di fricã sh-di ashtiptarea atsilor tsi va s-yinã tu lumi, cã puterili a tserurilor va s-trundueascã. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Atumtsea va s-veadã Hiljilu a Omlui yininda pri un nior cu fuchii sh-mãriri mari. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Cãndu s-ahurheascã si s-facã aesti, mutrits nsus shi sculats capitli a voastri, cã arãscumpãrarea a voastrã easti aproapi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hãbãrsirea Prufitipsitã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor unã parabolã: “Bãgats oarã hiclu sh-tuts ponjilji. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Cãndu ahurhescu s-da bubuchili, voi aduchits cã veara easti aproapi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ashãtsi sh-voi, cãndu s-videts cã ma s-fac aesti si shtits cã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui easti aproapi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Dealihea mini ma vã dzãc, cã nu va s-treacã aestã farã, pãnã-cãndu tuti aesti lucri si mplineascã. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Tserlu sh-loclu va s-treacã, ma zboarili a meali nu va s-treacã. <verse eid="LUK 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Bãgats oarã tsi ininjli a voastri si nu s-vã angreacã di mãcãri, di biuturi sh-di mirãchili a banãljei aishtei, tsi atsea dzuã s-nu vã yinã niashtiptatã. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Cã va s-yinã ca un cearcu pristi tuts atselji tsi bãneadzã tu fatsa a tut loclui. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Trã atsea, stats dishtiptat sh-rugats-vã totãna tra s-hits axii s-ascãpats di tuti atseali tsi va yinã shi s-ishits nãintea a Hiljilui a Omlui.” <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Tutã dzua Isusul nvitsa tu templu sh-noaptea u tritsea afoarã tu muntili a Masnjilor. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Populu tut, curundu dimineatsa, yinea la nãsu tu templu tra s-lu asculta.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Iuda Aleapsi s-Prida Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Tora ma s-apruchea sãrbãtorea a Adzãmilor, tsi s-acljeamã Pashti. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Mãrlji a preftsãlor shi scriblji cãfta cum s-lu vãtãma Isusul, ma avea fricã di populu. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Atumtsea, Satanlu intrã la Iuda, acljimat Iscariotul, cai eara un di doisprãdzatslji. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Elu s-dusi si zbura cu arhipreftsãlji sh-mãrlji a vigljitorilor tu templu cã, cu tsi ilei va lu pridãdea Isusul. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Elji s-hãrsirã shi lj-dzãsirã cã va l-plãteascã. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ashãtsi Iuda deadi zborlu sh-ashtipta oara s-lu pridãdea tu mãnjili a lor sh-ascumtu di multsãmea.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsina di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Vini dzua a Adzãmilor, sh-prindea s-fãtsea curban njelu di Pashti. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Isusul pitricu Petrul sh-Ioanul sh-lã dzãsi: “Dutsets-vã sh-ndridzets Pashtili, tra s-mãcãm.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Elji lu ntribarã: “Iu ts-arãseashti s-ndridzem?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Ia, cãndu s-intrats tu cãsãbã, va s-vã easã nãinti un om tsi tsãni un stamnã cu apã. Njidzets dupã nãsu tu casa iu va intrã elu. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Dzãtsets a nicuchirlui a casãljei: ‘Nvitsãtorlu vã-ntreabã: Iu easti udãlu tu cai pot s-mãc Pashtili deadun cu ucenitsilji a melji?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Atumtsea elu va s-vã aspunã un salã mari ashtirnutã di nsus. Aclo s-ndritsets!” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Elji neasirã sh-aflarã itsido ashã cum lã dzãsi Isusul sh-u ndreapsirã trã Pashti.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Cãndu vini oara, Isusul shidzu la measã deadun cu doisprãdzatsi apostulji. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Am avut multu vreari s-mãcam aestu Pashti deadun cu voi, nãinti tsi s-mi munduescu. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ma vã dzãc cã nu va s-mãcã ma altu Pashti, pãnã cãndu si mplineascã atsea tu amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Deapoea lo cupa, hãristisi sh-dzãsi: “Loats aestu sh-mpãrtsãts-lu namisa di voi. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Mini ma vã dzãc cã nu va s-beau ma di frutlu a-ayinjãljei pãnã cãndu s-yinã amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Deapoea lo pãnea, hãristisi, u frãmsi sh-lã-u deadi a-lor dzãcãnda: “Aestã easti truplu a meu, tsi s-da trã voi. Fãtsets-u aestã tra s-mi adutsets aminti mini!” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ashãtsi featsi sh-dupã tsinã, lo cupa sh-dzãsi: “Aestã cupã easti pisti-ligãtura atsea noaua tu sãndzili a meu, tsi s-vearsi trã voi. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ma ia, mãna atsilui tsi mi vindi, easti cu mini la measã. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Hiljilu a Omlui s-dutsi ashã cum easti arãdãpsitã trã nãsu, ma cavai di omlu tsi lu vindi!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Atumtsea elji apãrnjirã si s-ntreabã cu un-alantu cã cai di elji poati s-hibã atsel tsi va s-facã aestã.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cai Easti ma Marli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Namisa di elji apãrnji unã ncãceari cã cai di elji prindi s-hibã ma marli. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Atumtsea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Amiradzlji a natsiunilor domnescu pri nãshi sh-atselji tsi au autoritati pristi nãshi s-acljeam ghini-fãcãtori. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Cu voi nu prindi hibã ashãtsi. Ma marli di voi s-hibã ca atsel ma njiclu, sh-caplu ca atsel tsi huzmitipseashti. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Cai easti ma mari, atsel tsi sta la measã, ama atsel tsi chirniseashti? Vahi nu easti atsel tsi sta la measã? Ma mini escu tu mesea a voastrã trãsh ca atsel tsi chirniseashti. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Voi hits atselji tsi stãturã cu mini tu provãli a meali. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ashãtsi mini vã dau unã amirãrilji ashã cum nji-u deadi a njia Tatãl a meu, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />tsi voi s-mãcats shi s-bets la measa a mea tu amirãriljea a mea. Voi va s-shidets pri thronuri giudicãnda di doisprãdzatsi fãrili al Israel.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Atumtsea Domnul dzãsi: “Simon, Simon, ia Satanlu ari cãftat s-vã ntsearnã ca grãnul. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mini mi am rugat trã tini, Simon, tsi pistipsirea a ta s-nu s-ascapã, sh-tini cãndu s-ti tornji, nvãrtusheadzã fratslji a tãlji.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Doamne, mini escu etimu s-mi duc deadun cu tini tu hapsi sh-tu moarti.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Petro, mini ts-dzãc cã azã cucotlu nu va cãntã, nãinti tsi tini s-mi aleapidz di trei ori cã mi cunoshti mini.” <verse eid="LUK 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãndu vã pitricui fãrã pungã, fãrã trastu sh-fãrã sandali, vã lipsi tsiva?” Sh-elji apãndisirã: “Tsiva.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Deapoea elu dzãsi: “Ma tora cai ari unã pungã si-u ljea cu nãsu, tutashã sh-trastu. Cai nu ari, s-vindã stranjilu a lui shi s-acumpãrã unã spatã. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Mini ma vã dzãc cã tsi easti scriatã prindi si mplineascã tu mini: ‘Sh-elu easti numirat ca arãu-fãcãtor.’ Cã atseali tsi suntu scriati trã mini va s-aibã bitisita a lor.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Atumtsea elji dzãsirã: “Doamne, ia, aoa suntu doauã spãtsi.” Ma elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nimal!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Roagã tu Muntili a Masnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Deapoea Isusul ishi ca totãna shi dusi pri muntili a Masnjilor, sh-ucenitsilji a lui s-dusirã dupã nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Cãndu agiumsi tu atsel loc, lã dzãsi a lor: “Rugats-vã tra s-nu cãdets tu cãrteari.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Apoea s-dipãrtã di elji, cãt unã arucãturã di cheatrã sh-cãdzu pri dzinuclji shi s-ruga, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />dzãcãnda: “Tate, ma s-vrei, dipãrteadz-u aestã cupã di la mini! Cu tut atsea, s-nu si s-fac vrearea a mea, ma a ta.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Atumtsea s-aspusi un anghil dit tser tra s-lji da fuchii a lui. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ashãtsi elu hiinda tu sicleti, s-ruga sh-ma multu. Asudoarea a lui s-featsi ca chicutã di sãndzi tsi cãdea mpadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Deapoea si sculã di la rugãciuni vini la ucenitsilji a lui sh-lji aflã durnjinda acurmats di nvirinarea. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Atumtsea lã dzãsi: “Cãtse ma durnjits? Sculats-vã sh-rugats-vã tra s-nu cãdets tu cãrteari!”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Ligat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Cãndu elu ma zbura ninga, vini unã multsãmi. Atsel tsi s-acljima Iuda, un di doisprãdzatsi, imnãnda nãinti, lji s-apruche al Isus tra s-lu bashi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Iuda, cu bãshari tini ma vindzi Hiljilu a Omlui?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Atumtsea atselji di anvãrliga di nãsu, vidzãnda cã tsi va s-undzea, l-u ntribarã: “Doamne, s-lji agudim cu spatã?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Un di elji agudi cu spatã huzmichearlu a arhipreftlui shi lj-tãlje ureaclja atsea ndreapta. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Isusul lã dzãsi: “Nimal ashãtsi!” Bãgã mãna la ureaclja a lui sh-u vindicã. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a arhipreftsãlor, a vigljitorilor a templui sh-a aushlor tsi avea vinit trã nãsu: “Avets ishit trã mini cu spãtsi sh-cu ciumãdzi ca contra a unui fur? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Cathi dzuã mini earam cu voi tu templu, voi nu mi acãtsat. Ma aestã easti oara a puteariljei di scutidi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul aleapid Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Dupã tsi lu acãtsarã Isusul, lu dusirã la casã a arhipreftlui. Iarã Petrul lu urma di diparti. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Aclo elji apreasirã un foc tu mesea a uborlui shi s-apunarã deadun. Petrul s-apunã cu elji. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Unã huzmichearã vidzu Petrul apunatã ningã foc sh-mutrinda cãtrã nãsu lj-dzãsi: “Sh-aestu eara cu nãsu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ma elu alipidãnda lj-dzãsi: “Muljeari, nu l-cunoscu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Dupã putsãn chiro un altu l-vidzu Petrul sh-lji dzãsi: “Sh-tini eshti di atselji.” Iarã Petrul dzãsi: “Om, nu escu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Dupã unã oarã di chiro, un altu ipiminisi: “Dealihea cã sh-aestu eara deadun cu nãsu, cã easti Galilean.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ma Petrul lj-dzãsi: “Om, nu shtiu tsi dzãtsi!” Tu atsea oarã, cãndu elu ninga ma grea, cãntã cucotlu. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Atumtsea Domnul s-turnã sh-vidzu cãtrã Petrul. A Petrului lj-vinirã tu minti zboarili tsi lj-avea dzãsã Domnul: “Nãinti tsi s-cãntã cucotlu azã, tini va mi aleapidz di trei ori.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Atumtsea Petrul ishi afoarã sh-plãmsi cu amãreatsã.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vigljitorlji Pizuirã Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Oaminjlji tsi l-vigljea Isusul lu pizuea sh-lu bãtea. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Elji lji ncljisirã ocljilji sh-lu ntriba dzãcãnda: “Prufitipsea, cai ti agudii?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Blãstimãnda dzãtsea multi zboari greali contra a lui. <verse eid="LUK 22:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Cãndu s-featsi dzuã, s-adunarã deadun aushlji a popului, arhipreftsãlji sh-scriblji sh-lu dusirã Isusul tu sinedriul a lor, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />dzãcãnda: “Macã tini eshti Hristolu, dzã-nã!” Ma elu lã dzãsi: “Sh-ma s-vã dzãc, nu va s-mi pistipsits. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Sh-ma s-vã ntribam, voi nu va nj-dãdeat apandisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Di tora sh-nclo Hiljilu a Omlui va sheadã tu nandreapta al Dumnidzãu puternic.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Atumtsea tuts dzãsirã: “Eshti tini Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui?” Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi ma dzãtsets cã mini escu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Atumtsea elji dzãsirã: “Trã tsi altã mãrtirii avem ananghi? Noi idyilji u-avdzãm di gura a lui.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nãintea al Pilat sh-al Herod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Atumtsea si sculã tutã multsãmea, sh-lu dusirã Isusul nãintea al Pilat. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Aclo ahurhirã s-lu acuza dzãcãnda: “Aestu om lu aflãm aljumtrãnda mintea a popului a nostru, nchidicãnda s-plãtea taxa al Cezar, dzãcãnda cã easti Hristolu amirã.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Atumtsea Pilatul lu ntribã: “Tini eshti amirãlu a Iudeilor?” Isusul lj-apãndisi: “Tini idyiul ma dzãtsi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Atumtsea Pilatul lã dzãsi a mãrlor a preftsãlor sh-a popului: “Mini nu ma aflu vãrã cãbati la aestu om.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ma elji ipiminisea dzãcãnda: “Elu ma scoalã populu tu rebilipsiri nvitsãnda oaminjlji pri tutã Iudea, apãrnjinda dit Galilea sh-pãnã aoa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Cãndu Pilatul avdzã cã si zbura di Galilea, ntribã macã atsel om eara Galilean. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Cara lo di hãbari cã Isusul eara dit loclu tsi eara sum domniljea al Herod, lu pitricu la Herod, cai tu atseli dzãli eara sh-elu tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Cãndu Herodul lu vidzu Isusul, s-hãrsi multu. Elu di multu chiro vrea s-lu videa, cã avea avdzãtã multu ti nãsu, sh-avea nãdii s-lu videa fãcãnda vãrã thavmã. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Elu lu ntribã trã multi lucri Isusul, ma Isusul nu lj-apãndisi dip. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Aclo eara sh-mãrlji a preftsãlor sh-scriblji tsi lu acuza cu aspru. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herodul cu suldatslji a lui lu ngiurarã sh-lu pizuirã, sh-deapoea lu nviscurã cu stranji lunjinoasi shi l-pitricurã la Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Atsea dzuã Pilatul sh-Herodul s-featsirã oaspi cu un-alantu, cã ma nãinti eara dushmanji.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Atumtsea Pilatul acljimã arhipreftsãlji, mãrlji sh-populu <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />sh-lã dzãsi: “Voi nj-adusit aestu om tsi rebilipseashti populu. Mini lu ntribai nãintea a voastrã sh-nu aflai la aestu om vãrã cãbati trã cai voi lu acuzats, <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />sh-nitsi Herodul, cã elu lu turnã la noi. Elu nu ari faptã tsiva tsi s-u-axizeascã moartea. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Trã atsea dupã tsi va lu zãpãleascã, va lu alasã.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[La sãrbãtoarea a Pashtiljei, guvernatorlji prindea si sãlãghea un hãpsãnit.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tu alantã manuscrisi nu s-aflã aestu versu</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Tu atsea oarã tuts aurlarã cu unã boatsi dzãcãnda: “Ljea-lu aestu sh-sãlãghea-nã Baraba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Aestu eara bãgat tu hapsi trã un rebilipsiri tsi eara faptã tu cãsãbã sh-trã vãtãmari. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Trã atsea Pilatul vrãnda s-lã sãlãgheascã Isusul, lã grãi nãpoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ma elji aurla dzãcãnda: “Crutsisits-lu! Crutsisits-lu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi di a treia oarã a-lor: “Ma tsi arãu ari faptã aestu? Mini nu aflai vãrã cãbati la nãsu tsi s-axizeascã moartea. Trã atsea dupã tsi va lu zãpãlescu, va lu sãlãghescu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ma elji ipiminisea cu boatsi analtã cãftãnda s-lu crutsisea. Aurlãrili a lor s-featsirã dominanti. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Atumtsea Pilatul apofãsi tsi si mplineascã cãftarea a lor. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Elu sãlãghi atsel tsi eara hãpsãnit trã rebilipsiri sh-vãtãmari, tsi elji lu cãfta. Ma Isusul lu prideadirã dupã voljea a lor.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Crutsisirea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Cãndu ma lu dutsea ti crutsisiri, acãtsarã un om cu numa Simon dit Cirena, tsi yinea dit cãmpu, lji bãgarã sh-a lui crutsea tsi s-u purta dupã Isusul. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Unã multsãmi mari di oaminji njidzea dupã nãsu, sh-muljerili bãtea cheptul sh-vãita trã nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Isusul s-turnã cãtrã eali sh-lã dzãsi: “Hiljili al Ierusalem, nu plãndzets trã mini, ma plãndzets trã voi sh-trã cilimenjlji a voshtri. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ma yinã dzãlili tsi va s-dzãcã: ‘Ca hara di muljerili stearpi sh-cahara di pãntitsli tsi pute nu au amintatã sh-sinili tsi pute nu au ntricatã.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Atumtsea va s-apãrnjeascã s-lã dzãcã a muntsãlor: ‘Cãdets pristi noi!’ shi a dzenurilor: ‘Anvãlits-nã!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Cã macã s-fatsi ashã cu lemnul atsel veardili, tsi va s-fãcã cu atsel uscatlu?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Elji adusirã sh-doi altsã arãu-fãcãtori deadun cu nãsu trã vãtãmari. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Cãndu agiumsirã tu loclu tsi s-acljima “Cafca”, aclo lu crutsisirã Isusul sh-arãu-fãcãtorlji: unlu tu nandreapta a lui shi alatu tu nastãnga a lui. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Atumtsea Isusul dzãsi: “Tate, ljeart-lji atselji cã nu shti tsi fac.” Apoea arcarã soarti sh-pãrtsãrã stranjili a lui. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Populu stãtea aclo sh-videa. Iarã mãrlji arãdea cu Isusul dzãcãnda: “Altsãlji lji ascãpã. Macã alihea easti Hristolu, aleptul al Dumnidzãu s-ascapã bana a lui.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Arãdea sh-suldatslji. Elji lji s-apruchearã sh-lji deadirã puscã, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />sh-lji dzãtsea: “Macã tini eshti amirãlu a Iudeilor, ascapã-ti!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Prisuprã di nãsu eara unã scriturã: “AESTU EASTI AMIRÃLU A IUDEILOR.” <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ma un di arãu-fãcãtorlji crutsisit blãstimãnda lj-dzãsi: “Nu eshti tini Hristolu? Ascapã-ti tini sh-apoea nã ascapã sh-noi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ma alantu apãndisinda lu vãrghi: “Nu ai fricã di Dumnidzãlu, cã eshti tu idyia condamnã? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Noi him giudicatã cu ndriptati, sh-ma lom condamna tsi prindi trã atseali tsi avem faptã, iarã aestu nu ari faptã vãrã arãu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Deapoea lj-dzãsi: “Isuse, adu aminti di mini cãndu va yinji tu mirãriljea a ta.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Isusul lj-dzãsi: “Dealihea ma ts-dzãc azã, cã va s-hii cu mini tu paradis.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Eara njeadzã-dzuã shi scutidlu anvãli tut loclu pãnã la oara trei dupã prãndzu. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Soarili si ntunicã sh-velul a templui s-pãrtsã tu doauã. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Atumtsea Isusul grãi cu boatsi analtã sh-dzãsi: “Tate, tu mãnjili a tali ma lu dau duhlu a meu!” Sh-cum dzãsi aestã, deadi duh. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Cãndu vidzu cã tsi s-featsi, tsenturionlu multumãri Dumnidzãlu dzãcãnda: “Dealihea aestu om eara ndreptu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Tut multsãmea tsi eara adunat s-videa tsi s-fãtsea, cãndu vidzu aestã, s-turnã a casã bãtãnda cheptul a lor. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Iarã tuts cunuscutslji a lui deadun cu muljerili a lor tsi yinea dupã nãsu di Galilea, stãtea diparti vidzãnda aesti.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngruparea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Aclo eara un bãrbat cu numa Iosif, membru tu consiliu, om bun sh-ndreptu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Elu nu avea aprovat planu sh-atsea tsi fãtsea elji. Elu eara di Arimatea, cãsãbãlu a Iudeiljei sh-ashtipta amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Iosiful s-dusi nãintea al Pilat sh-lji cãftã truplu al Isus. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Atumtsea elu lu dipunã dit crutsi, lu nfãshe cu unã pãndzã di ljin sh-lu bãgã tu un murmintu sãpat tu cheatrã, iu nu s-eara bãgat pute vãrã altu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Sh-eara dzua a Etimãsiriljei sh-apãrnjea Sãmbãta. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Muljerili tsi avea vinit cu Isusul dit Galilea urmãnda, vidzurã murmintul sh-cum fu bãgat truplu al Isus. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Eali s-turnarã a casã sh-etimãsirã njurizmi buni sh-untulem njirusit. Sãmbãta s-discrumarã dupã legea.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Nyearea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, curund dimineatsa, muljerili loarã njurizmili atseali buni etimãsiti sh-vinirã la murmintu. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Eali aflarã cheatra arãsturnatã dit murmintu. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Deapoea intrarã nãuntru, ma nu lu aflarã truplu al Domnul Isus. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ashãtsi cum eara cihtisiti di aestã, ia, doi bãrbats nviscuts cu stranji lunjinoasi, stãturã ningã eali. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Muljerili s-aspãrarã sh-apunarã caplu nghios. Ma bãrbatslji lã dzãsirã: “Cãtse cãftats yiulu ntrã mortsãlji? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Nu easti aoa, easti nyeat. Adutsets-vã aminti cum vã dzãsi cãndu ninga eara tu Galilea: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Hiljilu a Omlui prindi si s-da tu mãnjili a amãrtioshilor, va si s-crutsiseascã sh-va si nyeadzã a treia dzuã.’” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Eali adusirã a minti zboarili a lui. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Cãndu s-turnarã di la murmintu, li aspusirã tuti aesti a Unsprãdzatsilor sh-a tuts alantsãlor. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Eali tsi aspusirã a apostuljilor aesti eara: Maria Magdalena, Ioana, Maria, muma al Iacov sh-alanti muljeri tsi eara cu nãshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Zboarili aesti a muljerilor lã si pãrurã ca zboari goali sh-nu li pistipsirã. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Cu tut atsea Petrul si sculã shi s-dusi trãoarã la murmintul. S-aplicã sh-vidzu nãuntru. Aclo eara singur fãshili di ljin adunati. Deapoea fudzi, ciudisitã di atseali tsi avea undzit.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Calea cãtrã Emaus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Tu idyia dzuã, doi di atselji ma njidzea tu unã hoarã cu numa Emaus, shapti milji diparti di Ierusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Elji ma zbura cu un-alantu ti atseali tsi avea undzitã. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Cãndu elji zbura sh-cuvinta, Isusul s-apruche sh-imnã deadun cu elji. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ma ocljilji a lor eara nviscuti tra s-lu cunushtea. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Elu lã ntribã: “Tsi suntu aesti muabeti tsi fãtsets cu un-alantu imnãnda?” Elji stãturã mproshtsã shi s-videa ca nvirinats. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Atumtsea un di atselji cu numa Cleopa, apãndisinda lj-dzãsi: “Tini eshti singur xen tu Ierusalem tsi nu ai loat di hãbari atseali tsi au undzitã aclo aesti dzãli?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Elu lã ntribã: “Tsi?” Elji lj-dzãsirã: “Atseali al Isus di Nazaret, tsi eara un prufit puternic tu zboari sh-tu fapti nãintea al Dumnidzãu sh-a tut popului. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Arhipreftsãlji sh-mãrlji a noshtri lu deadirã s-giudicã cu moarti sh-lu crutsisirã. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Noi aveam nãdii cã elu eara atsel tsi va s-arãscumpãr Israelul. Cu tut atsea azã easti a treia dzuã di cãndu undzirã aesti. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Niscãnti muljeri di a noastri nã ciudisirã, cãndu s-dusirã dimineatsa tahina la murmintu. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Eali nu aflarã aclo truplu a lui sh-vinirã dzãcãnda cã avea vidzutã un viziuni di anghilji, cai dzãtsea cã elu easti yiu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Niscãntsã di noi s-dusirã la murmintu sh-lu aflarã ashã cum dzãsirã muljerili, ma Isusul nu lu vidzurã.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nimintimenji sh-aĝalnitsi tu inimã tra s-pistipsitsã itsido tsi au dzãsã prufitsilji! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Nu prindea tsi Hristolu si s-munduia shi s-intra tu mãrirea a lui?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Deapoea elu apãrnji cu Moisiul sh-cu tuts Prufitsilji s-lã aspunea a lor tuti Scriturili tsi grea trã nãsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Cãndu s-apruchearã la hoarã iu ma njidzea, Isusul featsi canda va s-fudzea ma nclo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Atumtsea elji lji featsirã rigeai sh-lji dzãsirã: “Shedz cu noi, cã ma yini seara sh-dzua s-apridunã.” Atumtsea elu intrã tra s-armãnea cu nãshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Cãndu eara la measã cu elji, Isusul lo pãnea, u ghinicuvãntã, u frãmsi sh-lã u pãrtsã a-lor. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Atumtsea a-lor lã si discljisirã ocljilji sh-lu cunuscurã, ma elu fudzi di la elji. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Atumtsea elji dzãsirã cu un-alantu: “Nu nã ardea inima di nãuntru, cãndu elu nã grea pri cali sh-cãndu nã discljidea Scriturili?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Tu atsea oarã si scularã shi s-turnarã la Ierusalem, sh-aflarã adunats atselji unsprãdzatsi sh-alantsãlji tsi eara cu nãshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Elji dzãtsea: “Domnul easti nyeat dealihea sh-lji si fãnirusi al Simon.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Atumtsea atselji dolji aspusirã atseali tsi undzirã pri cali sh-cum lu avea cunuscutã la frãndzearea a pãniljei.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul s-Fãnirusi a Ucenitsilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Cãndu elji ma zbura trã aesti, Isusul dãnãsi namisa di elji sh-lã dzãsi: “Pacea cu voi!” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Elji tulburats sh-lãhtãrsits minduia cã ma videa un duh. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Atumtsea elu lã dzãsi: “Cãtse hits tulburats sh-trã tse tu ininjli a voastri ma amintã ahãnti shubei? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Videts mãnjili a meali sh-cicioarili a meali. Mini escu! Ahulits-mi sh-videts. Duhlu nu ari carni sh-oasi, ashãtsi cum am mini.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Sh-cum dzãsi aesti, lã aspusi mãnjili sh-cicioarili. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Metsi elji nu ma pistipsea ninga di haraua shi s-ciudisea, Isusul lã dzãsi: “Avets aoa tsiva trã mãcari?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Elji lji deadirã unã bãcatã di pescu friptu. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Elu lu lo sh-mãcã nãintea a lor. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Deapoea lã dzãsi: “Aesti suntu zboarili tsi mini vã dzãtseam cãndu earam ninga cu voi, cã prindi si mplineascã tuti atseali tsi suntu scriati trã mini tu Legea al Moisiu, la Prufitsilji sh-tu Psalnjili.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Apoea lã-u discljisi mintea tra s-li aducheascã Scriturili, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />sh-lã dzãsi: “Ashãtsi easti scriat sh-ashãtsi prindea s-munduea Hristolu shi-s-nyea dit mortsã a treia dzuã. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Ashãtsi apãrnjinda di Ierusalem, s-preadicã tu numa a lui la tuti natsiunili mitãnjiusirea sh-ljirtarea a amãrtiilor. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Voi hits martiri trã aesti. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ia, mini ma pitrec pri voi cã tsi tãxi Tatãl a meu, ma voi armãnets tu cãsãbãlu al Ierusalem pãnã-cãndu s-vã nvishtets cu puteari di nsus.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anãltsarea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Deapoea lji sotsãsi nafoarã cãtrã Betania sh-sculãnda mãnjili, lji ghinicuvãntã. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Anda lji ghinicuvãntã, s-dispãrtsã di elji shi lu anãltsarã tu tser. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Elji si ncljinarã shi s-turnarã tu Ierusalem cu harauã mari. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Elji eara dipriunã tu templu alãvdãnda Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>